	quest.01C2FCECC7432EA9.quest_subtitle: "GigantaMax"
	quest.02EEA385BE48B6DF.quest_desc: ["Apparently &#8E44ADGiratina&f is on this lost island, &#E74C3CForgotten&f and &#E74C3CAbandoned&f in this world."]
	quest.02EEA385BE48B6DF.quest_subtitle: "Finding the island"
	quest.02EEA385BE48B6DF.title: "Find Giratina Island"
	quest.043C0ACC593D2953.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBKyurem&f will surely warn &5Eternatus&f that we are already on our &#FFD700Way&f, so let's skip the &#FFD700Rest of our Training&f and dive &#2ECC71Straight into Battle&f right now!"]
	quest.043C0ACC593D2953.quest_subtitle: "Danger is here!"
	quest.043C0ACC593D2953.title: "Kyurem"
	quest.0494B3589BDC5BCC.quest_desc: [
		"&#8E44ADEternatus&f - Thank you &#3498DBTrainer&f, &#2ECC71peace&f has returned to the &#3498DBPokémon Kingdom&f... in this &#8E44ADancient world&f there are still many things to be discovered, many &#3498DBmysteries&f..."
		""
		"&#2ECC71However&f, I don't think &#8E44ADBen&f will be one of them, I think after defeating &#3498DBAlakazam&f he must flee to the &#8E44ADmountains&f!"
		""
		"Good journey, &#3498DBTrainer&f!"
	]
	quest.0494B3589BDC5BCC.quest_subtitle: "Peace"
	quest.0494B3589BDC5BCC.title: "The End"
	quest.069E6B204F8C63A4.quest_desc: ["He doesn't seem to be in the &#9B59B6End&f... let's return to the &#2ECC71Normal World&f and go after the &#FFD700Strongest &#FFD700Pokémon&f!"]
	quest.069E6B204F8C63A4.quest_subtitle: "He's playing with us"
	quest.069E6B204F8C63A4.title: "What?"
	quest.07732834E27CAB2E.quest_desc: ["To prevent &#3498DBPokémon&f from running far away, we can create an enclosure with &#A04000Fences&f&f; this helps ensure the &#3498DBPokémon&f don't run away."]
	quest.07732834E27CAB2E.quest_subtitle: "Preventing escapes"
	quest.07732834E27CAB2E.title: "Fence"
	quest.07772F317EDD6A2C.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.07772F317EDD6A2C.title: "I AM NEXT TO THE SUN"
	quest.078B89BA78DD1034.quest_desc: ["This is only the &#FF5733Beginning&f, trainer, let's go! To our next &#3498DBObjective&f!"]
	quest.078B89BA78DD1034.quest_subtitle: "Only the beginning"
	quest.078B89BA78DD1034.title: "Next henchman"
	quest.088DBF578D0C04F0.quest_desc: ["Calm down, you didn't think we'd go after the first minion with you and your &#E74C3CLevel 10 Pokémon&f, did you? Train your Pokémon a bit and &#2ECC71Evolve It&f, it will be &#3498DBExtremely Necessary&f. For that, defeat some &#FF5733Pokémon Scattered Around the World&f!"]
	quest.088DBF578D0C04F0.quest_subtitle: "Training Pokémon"
	quest.088DBF578D0C04F0.title: "Defeat Pokémon"
	quest.098108C1B0208DB0.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBReshiram&f stays in a beautiful &#2ECC71Biome&f, but it is very &#E74C3CDangerous&f and treacherous, don't believe its &#E67E22Words&f! By clicking on the &#FFD700Reward&f, the &#E74C3CBoss&f will appear!"]
	quest.098108C1B0208DB0.quest_subtitle: "Going after the minion"
	quest.098108C1B0208DB0.title: "Find Sunflower Plains"
	quest.0984B249194FB2F0.quest_desc: [
		"This giant was a &#E74C3CPhysical&f &#E74C3CMonster&f! It could do &#2ECC71Anything&f! It will be very &#9B59B6Useful&f for you."
		""
		"In the summoning room, step on each circle to light it up. Once each circle is lit, a level 40 &#E67E22Regirock&f will &#2ECC71Spawn&f!"
	]
	quest.0984B249194FB2F0.quest_subtitle: "Time to smash everything"
	quest.0984B249194FB2F0.title: "Catch Regirock"
	quest.0A5CA834F6BCBAE9.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.0A5CA834F6BCBAE9.title: "IT'S TOO COLD"
	quest.0B2F0861F73CEE4B.quest_desc: ["Let's take this opportunity to &#F1C40FStrengthen&f our &#3498DBTeam&f! Capture new &#3498DBPokémons&f."]
	quest.0B2F0861F73CEE4B.quest_subtitle: "New captures"
	quest.0CBEE3692E16D9B2.quest_desc: ["For a &#3498DBPokémon&f to change its &#E67E22Type&f, you need to turn in 50 &#3498DBTera Shards&f specific to it!"]
	quest.0CBEE3692E16D9B2.quest_subtitle: "Changing type"
	quest.0CCEBA583660280D.quest_desc: ["Using &#FF5733Wands&f for building is an absolute &#3498DBGame Changer&f! Being able to place a &#2ECC71Whole Wall&f or fill a floor in seconds makes constructing bases and houses so much smoother."]
	quest.0CCEBA583660280D.quest_subtitle: "Building easier"
	quest.0D409F3E33BA1257.quest_desc: ["One of the pillars of our &#3498DBUnion&f with &#3498DBPokémon&f was &#3498DBUxie&f, &#3498DBMesprit&f, and &#3498DBAzelf&f, and now they are in a &#E74C3CDungeon&f. We need to &#2ECC71Rescue&f them! Find the &#E74C3CStructure&f holding each one and set them &#2ECC71Free&f!"]
	quest.0D409F3E33BA1257.quest_subtitle: "3 Pokémon and 1 pillar"
	quest.0D409F3E33BA1257.title: "Pillar"
	quest.0D88E60491704C4E.quest_desc: ["Generally in &#3498DBForest&f or &#3498DBPlains&f biomes, we can find the &#3498DBLake&f &#3498DBVerity&f structure, home of &#3498DBMesprit&f."]
	quest.0D88E60491704C4E.quest_subtitle: "Finding Mesprit"
	quest.0D88E60491704C4E.title: "Find Lake Valor"
	quest.0DB3DEDD62A0C244.quest_desc: ["Now let's go after two &#F1C40FLegendaries&f that are among the most powerful we have ever managed to capture in our &#3498DBWorld&f..."]
	quest.0DB3DEDD62A0C244.quest_subtitle: "Dialga and Palkia"
	quest.0DB3DEDD62A0C244.title: "Find Spear Pillar"
	quest.0E651D3C9406F656.quest_desc: [
		"Okay, let's go after the &#F1C40FCreator&f of the entire universe! &#F1C40FArceus&f."
		""
		"Now it's for real!"
		""
		"For this, we first need to have summoned &#3498DBDialga&f, &#3498DBPalkia&f, and &#8E44ADGiratina&f! And with their items, craft the &#3498DBAzure Flute&f."
		""
		"Take the &#3498DBAzure Flute&f and play it!"
	]
	quest.0E651D3C9406F656.quest_subtitle: "After Arceus"
	quest.0EAD6A9175B9C6B3.quest_desc: ["Speechless! &#2ECC71Incredible&f, this &#3498DBPokémon&f will be &#F1C40FPerfect&f in any &#3498DBTeam&f! &#2ECC71Congratulations&f and thank you for helping us, &#3498DBTrainer&f!"]
	quest.0EAD6A9175B9C6B3.quest_subtitle: "WOW"
	quest.0EAD6A9175B9C6B3.title: "Gengar Captured"
	quest.0F17AD20C4165689.quest_desc: [
		"&#3498DBCobalion&f was one of our best &#2ECC71Guards&f, but he went crazy and ended up falling &#E74C3CIll&f."
		""
		"However, we can find him by his &#FFD700Paws&f; all over the &#9B59B6World&f we can find his &#E67E22Footprints&f on the ground, collect &#F1C40F50&f and watch him appear!"
	]
	quest.0F17AD20C4165689.quest_subtitle: "Footprints"
	quest.0F17AD20C4165689.title: "Cobalion Footprints"
	quest.0F1F0FFDBB47636C.quest_desc: ["&#2ECC71Congratulations&f &#2ECC71Trainer&f, you were &#2ECC71Amazing&f! However, that was only the &#2ECC71Tutorial&f, now the &#2ECC71Real&f &#2ECC71Game&f begins! &#E74C3CEternatus&f has kidnapped the &#2ECC71Strongest&f and most &#E74C3CFeared&f ones!"]
	quest.0F1F0FFDBB47636C.quest_subtitle: "Things are getting serious!"
	quest.0F1F0FFDBB47636C.title: "Next henchman"
	quest.100947C997B9EBDF.quest_desc: ["Use this compass to find new &cStructures&f!"]
	quest.100947C997B9EBDF.quest_subtitle: "Finding structures"
	quest.1089F826C02ADDDD.quest_desc: [
		"To summon &#9B59B6Cosmog&f, we need to use the &#3498DBCataclysm&f to collect all the &#3498DBCosmic Dust&f scattered across The &#9B59B6End&f! "
		""
		"And on the 50th time, &#9B59B6Cosmog&f will appear!"
	]
	quest.1089F826C02ADDDD.quest_subtitle: "Things on the ground"
	quest.10D75A8B87011178.quest_subtitle: "YOU WILL BE FINE TRAINER"
	quest.10D75A8B87011178.title: "WAKE UP! IT'S AN ILLUSION"
	quest.114B4A6FAAD8EC7F.quest_desc: [
		"Placing items on the &#3498DBPokémon&f we are breeding is extremely &#E74C3CNecessary&f. Using &#FFD700Bracelets&f we can pass the &#E67E22IVs&f of the mother or father to the &#2ECC71Offspring&f, each &#FFD700Bracelet&f maintains one &#E67E22IV&f:"
		""
		"&#3498DBPower Weight&f (&#E74C3CHP&f)"
		"&#3498DBPower Bracer&f (&#E74C3CAttack&f)"
		"&#3498DBPower Belt&f (&#E74C3CDefense&f)"
		"&#3498DBPower Lens&f (&#9B59B6Sp. Attack&f)"
		"&#3498DBPower Band&f (&#9B59B6Sp. Defense&f)"
		"&#3498DBPower Anklet&f (&#2ECC71Speed&f)"
	]
	quest.114B4A6FAAD8EC7F.quest_subtitle: "Maintaining IVs"
	quest.114B4A6FAAD8EC7F.title: "Bracelets"
	quest.11B34C4A472F3789.quest_desc: ["Our first &#E74C3CLegendary&f? &#FF5733Mew&f is &#3498DBFantastic&f!"]
	quest.11B34C4A472F3789.quest_subtitle: "After Mew"
	quest.11B34C4A472F3789.title: "Legendary!"
	quest.11C081D87DE537C5.quest_desc: ["Even a &#FFD700Legendary Mind&f like &#3498DBReshiram&f can get lost in its own &#E67E22Inventions&f! Sometimes letting go of what you &#F1C40FHave&f is the only way to truly &#2ECC71Grow&f."]
	quest.11C081D87DE537C5.quest_subtitle: "The best was done"
	quest.11C081D87DE537C5.title: "Reshiram Defeated"
	quest.120E9C25CA530BF0.quest_desc: ["To start, you need to find the &#9B59B6Megasites&f structure, and inside it you will find a &#FFD700Mega Stone&f!"]
	quest.120E9C25CA530BF0.quest_subtitle: "Starting to Mega Evolve"
	quest.120E9C25CA530BF0.title: "Find Megasite"
	quest.1269FFD13B557968.quest_desc: ["Arriving at their structure, we will see &#3498DBZamazenta's&f summoning pedestals, but we need &#F1C40F2 Items&f first: the &#FFD700Hero Shield&f and a &#FFD700Totem of Undying&f. To find the shield, you need to find a descent and complete a &#E74C3CMaze&f until you find the shield lying on the ground!"]
	quest.1269FFD13B557968.quest_subtitle: "Zamazenta"
	quest.12FAB8616D0B941E.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBCyurem&f was a &#E74C3CWrongdoer&f, defeating him was definitely the &#2ECC71Best Choice&f! Congratulations, &#FFD700Kid&f, we are one step closer to the end."]
	quest.12FAB8616D0B941E.quest_subtitle: "A good deed for society"
	quest.12FAB8616D0B941E.title: "Kyurem Defeated"
	quest.1435FC1C9011FD69.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBGreat choice&f, I believe this &#FF5733Greninja&f will be &#2ECC71Perfect&f for your &#E74C3CTeam&f."]
	quest.1435FC1C9011FD69.quest_subtitle: "Congratulations trainer"
	quest.1435FC1C9011FD69.title: "Greninja Captured"
	quest.1448B6C6DE404E0D.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.1448B6C6DE404E0D.title: "SOMEONE MAKE IT STOP"
	quest.15A4084F5440E153.quest_subtitle: "Ice Bird"
	quest.15C39491B4F364C2.quest_desc: ["A spectacular &#3498DBPokémon&f, and if well &#2ECC71Trained&f, &#3498DBKeldeo&f is extremely &#F1C40FStrong&f, though &#E74C3CCrazy&f."]
	quest.15C39491B4F364C2.quest_subtitle: "The incredible Keldeo"
	quest.15C39491B4F364C2.title: "Catch Keldeo"
	quest.15D8D60F54C98E67.quest_desc: ["The base update used to &#2ECC71Expand&f the &#F1C40FPoke&f &#F1C40FGenerator&f."]
	quest.15D8D60F54C98E67.quest_subtitle: "Upgrading the generator!"
	quest.164F58656ACA34BC.quest_desc: [
		"Trainer, one of the most important parts of &#3498DBPokémon&f is definitely &#F1C40FBreeding&f."
		""
		"With it we can get perfect &#3498DBPokémon&f, though it's very &#E74C3CDifficult&f. Let's learn a little bit: baby &#3498DBPokémon&f cannot be affected by &#3498DBEternatus&f."
		""
		"To start, craft a &#3498DBPasture Block&f."
	]
	quest.164F58656ACA34BC.quest_subtitle: "Time to breed"
	quest.16A609475E6C21B1.quest_desc: ["After gathering &#F1C40F5&f &#3498DBLunar&f &#3498DBFeathers&f, we can sound the &#F1C40FWand&f so &#3498DBCresselia&f will &#2ECC71Appear&f to us!"]
	quest.16A609475E6C21B1.quest_subtitle: "Sounding the whistle!"
	quest.17706C254C89E28A.quest_desc: ["Now with some &#2ECC71Apricorns&f and &#3498DBCopper&f, we can get our first &#FF5733Poké Balls&f."]
	quest.17706C254C89E28A.quest_subtitle: "Ready for capture"
	quest.17706C254C89E28A.title: "Poké Ball"
	quest.180D4C54D487F563.quest_desc: [
		"We have arrived and we are here!"
		""
		"Come at us, &#8E44ADEternatus&f!"
	]
	quest.180D4C54D487F563.quest_subtitle: "Lawless land"
	quest.198DCC7CE3FC00E0.quest_desc: [
		"In winter times this &#3498DBPokémon&f saved an entire village! "
		""
		"With the right moves, this &#3498DBPokémon&f is &#2ECC71Incredible&f! In the summoning room, step on each circle to light it up. Once each circle is lit, a level 40 &#3498DBRegice&f will be &#2ECC71Born&f."
	]
	quest.198DCC7CE3FC00E0.quest_subtitle: "Freezing everything"
	quest.198DCC7CE3FC00E0.title: "Catch Regice"
	quest.1A1146AA538489D0.quest_desc: [
		"&#9B59B6Cosmog&f and its evolutions... something magnificent! The &#F1C40FSun&f and the &#3498DBMoon&f in their own representation."
		""
		"To go after &#9B59B6Cosmog&f, craft a &#3498DBCosmic Cataclysm&f."
	]
	quest.1A1146AA538489D0.quest_subtitle: "After Cosmog"
	quest.1A5C5927DD06065A.quest_desc: ["We need to find &#3498DBVictini&f &#9B59B6Island&f. Once there, we can descend to its room, where the door will be locked by a &#E67E22Keyhole&f. Use the &#F1C40FPass&f to open it!"]
	quest.1A5C5927DD06065A.quest_subtitle: "Finding Victini"
	quest.1A5C5927DD06065A.title: "Find Liberty Island"
	quest.1A732C36B9E55827.quest_desc: ["We can build &#2ECC71Cables&f to carry &#F1C40FEnergy&f from the &#F1C40FPoke&f &#F1C40FGenerator&f to other &#2ECC71Workstations&f."]
	quest.1A732C36B9E55827.quest_subtitle: "Carrying energy"
	quest.1A732C36B9E55827.title: "Energy Pipe"
	quest.1A968D0C07CF3613.quest_desc: ["Haha, you are digging a deeper hole there! Better blame it on a &#E74C3CMisunderstanding&f with the &#F1C40FPoke&f &#F1C40FGenerator&f!"]
	quest.1A968D0C07CF3613.quest_subtitle: "Disobedient!"
	quest.1A968D0C07CF3613.title: "Catch Latias"
	quest.1AD372F03CE62528.quest_desc: [
		"This little big monster is a &#E74C3CTerror&f! Always mischievous, but very &#2ECC71Powerful&f if used well."
		""
		"To capture &#3498DBRegice&f we first need an &#3498DBIce&f &#3498DBGolem&f &#3498DBKey&f."
	]
	quest.1AD372F03CE62528.quest_subtitle: "An ice monster"
	quest.1B005490FD9C48DF.quest_desc: [
		"To face the next &#FFD700Battles&f, we need something truly &#F1C40FPowerful&f, so let's learn about &#FFD700Dynamax&f."
		""
		"To start, we can make a &#9B59B6Power Spot&f!"
	]
	quest.1B005490FD9C48DF.quest_subtitle: "Dynamax"
	quest.1B7BDB3D32F44B6E.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBCobalion&f is back! And his &#E74C3CParanoia&f doesn't stop hahaha don't mind that, &#F1C40FKid&f!"]
	quest.1B7BDB3D32F44B6E.quest_subtitle: "Our dog"
	quest.1B7BDB3D32F44B6E.title: "Catch Cobalion"
	quest.1B8A7A5A186B5A97.quest_desc: [
		"For some reason &#3498DBCresselia&f has been &#3498DBSleeping&f too much and saying things like Don't &#2ECC71Believe&f Him!, It's All A &#E74C3CLie&f, but it's important that you don't believe that... It's even better to &#2ECC71Defeat&f her instead of capturing."
		""
		"Perhaps &#2ECC71Defeating&f her is the solution. How about placing this &#F1C40FDream&f &#F1C40FCatcher&f right above your bed! That way we can collect &#F1C40F5&f &#3498DBLunar&f &#3498DBFeathers&f!"
	]
	quest.1B8A7A5A186B5A97.quest_subtitle: "Stealing dreams"
	quest.1BAE8B02EC98C6EE.quest_desc: ["Okay, now you're starting to get &#FF5733Strong&f, &#3498DBTrainer&f! But we have a lot to &#2ECC71Learn&f!"]
	quest.1BAE8B02EC98C6EE.quest_subtitle: "One step at a time!"
	quest.1BAE8B02EC98C6EE.title: "Next henchman"
	quest.1CBA9419C5569BB6.quest_desc: [
		"To go after &#FF5733Raikou&f, we need to create a &#F1C40FRaikou Treat&f! This will serve like a &#3498DBGlove&f for what we want."
		""
		"To summon the &#E74C3CLegendary&f, just use the &#FF5733Raikou Treat&f on one of the &#3498DBPedestals&f inside the &#2ECC71Village&f."
	]
	quest.1CBA9419C5569BB6.quest_subtitle: "Gather berries"
	quest.1CC2B2EF3D92501A.quest_desc: ["We urgently need to get &#E74C3CStronger&f! Our next challenge is &#C0392BInsane&f! Evolve your &#3498DBPokémon&f!"]
	quest.1CC2B2EF3D92501A.quest_subtitle: "Evolve your Pokémon 50 times"
	quest.1CC2B2EF3D92501A.title: "Evolve Pokémon"
	quest.1CCEE1A65AEF8F92.quest_subtitle: "OUR HEADS HURT"
	quest.1CCEE1A65AEF8F92.title: "LOST! WE ARE LOST"
	quest.1DF3CC688C7D183B.quest_desc: [
		"To go after &#FF5733Ho-Oh&f, we need the 3 feathers: &#3498DBBlue&f, &#F1C40FYellow&f, and &#E74C3CRed&f, which are obtained by spawning the 3 legendary beasts: &#E74C3CEntei&f, &#F1C40FRaikou&f, and &#3498DBSuicune&f!"
		""
		"By gathering them all we can craft this &#2ECC71Magical Feather&f!"
	]
	quest.1DF3CC688C7D183B.quest_subtitle: "Ho-oh?"
	quest.1E1BC8E9C5F88BDC.quest_desc: ["Don't give ideas to his barking hahaha."]
	quest.1E1BC8E9C5F88BDC.quest_subtitle: "Fight? Zacian is ready!"
