		"&#8E44ADEternatus&f - HAHAHAHA TRUTH WILL STILL CONSUME YOU, &#3498DBKID&f, IF THAT IS WHAT YOU DESIRE, COME TO ME, FIND ME IN \"&#8E44ADEternatus Cocoon&f\"."
		""
		"&#3498DBBen&f - The only truth is that &#8E44ADEternatus&f is a monster and wants the end of humanity."
	]
	quest.1E61523F323D8E9E.quest_subtitle: "Visiting Eternatus's home"
	quest.1E9EAAC3D51EAF74.quest_desc: ["We need to go after the &#9B59B6Megaroids&f structure next, and there we will need the &#FFD700Key Stone&f. To obtain it, we need to break a &#E67E22Keystone Ore&f."]
	quest.1E9EAAC3D51EAF74.quest_subtitle: "Another part"
	quest.1E9EAAC3D51EAF74.title: "Find Megaroids"
	quest.1F63D51CDB97181F.quest_desc: [
		"&#3498DBTMs&f are very &#2ECC71Important&f, a fundamental piece for &#3498DBPokémon&f. The right moves turn our &#3498DBPokémon&f into much &#2ECC71Stronger&f &#3498DBCreatures&f!"
		""
		"To craft some &#3498DBTMs&f we need the &#F1C40FTM&f &#F1C40FMachine&f. It works like a workbench: it will open a menu where we can select the move we want and the &#F1C40FMachine&f will ask for some items in return!"
	]
	quest.1F63D51CDB97181F.quest_subtitle: "Crafting TMs"
	quest.1F8914DAA9A39624.quest_desc: ["One of everyone's favorites in our world, he is very helpful!"]
	quest.1F8914DAA9A39624.quest_subtitle: "3 Legendary Beasts"
	quest.1F8914DAA9A39624.title: "Catch Raikou"
	quest.1F9AB5EABC775478.quest_desc: ["Regieleki is almost a healer for us, thanks for saving him!"]
	quest.1F9AB5EABC775478.quest_subtitle: "A pigeon?"
	quest.1F9AB5EABC775478.title: "Catch Regieleki"
	quest.2110992F228CB320.quest_desc: [
		"Trainer, I think your &#3498DBPokémon&f are already pretty &#2ECC71Strong&f, how about putting them to work as &#E74C3CSlaves&f? No wait, just kidding hahaha."
		""
		"Craft this first &#2ECC71Machine&f, it sucks the vital energy from &#3498DBPokémon&f and turns it into &#F1C40FPower&f, but I promise it doesn't hurt them!"
		""
		"Remember it only works with &#F1C40FElectric&f &#3498DBPokémon&f!"
	]
	quest.2110992F228CB320.quest_subtitle: "Generating energy with Pokémon"
	quest.211B4E583C0CC010.quest_desc: [
		"Exploring the &#2ECC71Jungle Temple&f, we can find a &#FF5733Strange Map&f... with this map it seems we can find an &#3498DBAncient Mew Temple&f."
		""
		"However, this map doesn't work like a map... maybe an &#E74C3CExploration Compass&f can help us!"
	]
	quest.211B4E583C0CC010.quest_subtitle: "A map?"
	quest.22739626E90297EB.quest_desc: [
		"To go after &#FF5733Entei&f, we need to create an &#E74C3CEntei Treat&f! This will serve like a &#3498DBGlove&f for what we want."
		""
		"To summon the &#E74C3CLegendary&f, just use the &#FF5733Entei Treat&f on one of the &#3498DBPedestals&f inside the &#2ECC71Village&f."
	]
	quest.22739626E90297EB.quest_subtitle: "Making feed"
	quest.23032560FD04D197.quest_subtitle: "Fire Bird"
	quest.236D17E2B677DD3F.quest_desc: [
		"&#3498DBVictini&f is one of the smartest &#3498DBPokémon&f we have, he is lost in this •9B59B6World&f, specifically in a place called &#2ECC71Liberty Garden&f."
		""
		"However, to free him, we need a &#F1C40FLiberty Pass&f which is found in a &#E67E22Desert Temple&f."
	]
	quest.236D17E2B677DD3F.quest_subtitle: "After freedom"
	quest.237FFE390BD507F6.quest_desc: [
		"These footprints belong to &#3498DBTerrakion&f, with a stronger &#E74C3CTemperament&f than normal..."
		""
		"To catch &#3498DBTerrakion&f, collect &#F1C40F50&f &#3498DBTerrakion Footprints&f scattered all over the &#9B59B6World&f!"
		""
		"He is an incredible &#3498DBPokémon&f if well &#2ECC71Trained&f!"
	]
	quest.237FFE390BD507F6.quest_subtitle: "More footprints"
	quest.239F9C34FC4B1A9C.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat all &#E74C3CPokémon&f summoned by the &#3498DBPokémon Trial Spawner&f inside the &#3498DBCave&f to be rewarded with the item \"&#F1C40FProof of Conquest&f\"."
		""
		"Right-click with the \"&#F1C40FProof of Conquest&f\" to summon &#9B59B6Mesprit&f."
	]
	quest.239F9C34FC4B1A9C.quest_subtitle: "Pink"
	quest.239F9C34FC4B1A9C.title: "Catch Mesprit"
	quest.243D3DA3A201D581.quest_subtitle: "No more nightmares"
	quest.243D3DA3A201D581.title: "Catch Darkrai"
	quest.24491FB0E73016B9.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.24491FB0E73016B9.title: "SOMETHING IS HURTING ME"
	quest.24660A5297794518.quest_desc: ["Place the &#2ECC71Farmer&f next to &#2ECC71Plantations&f and place &#2ECC71Grass&f-&#3498DBtype&f &#3498DBPokémon&f inside the &#2ECC71Workstation&f and it will help with &#2ECC71Farming&f."]
	quest.24660A5297794518.quest_subtitle: "Farming berries"
	quest.2495E33E07A947B2.quest_desc: ["To find &#3498DBUxie&f we need to go to the &#3498DBIce&f biome and find &#3498DBLake&f &#3498DBAcuity&f."]
	quest.2495E33E07A947B2.quest_subtitle: "Finding Uxie"
	quest.2495E33E07A947B2.title: "Find Lake Valor"
	quest.24CA0F686A9737E2.quest_desc: ["This &#FF5733Legendary&f is very &#3498DBCute&f and probably one of the &#2ECC71Smartest&f we've ever had in this world!"]
	quest.24CA0F686A9737E2.quest_subtitle: "A small legendary"
	quest.24CA0F686A9737E2.title: "Yellow Apricorn"
	quest.24E87F7032F3E5F3.quest_desc: ["To summon &#FF5733Celebi&f we need the &#3498DBGS Ball&f! Craft it with the obtained &#2ECC71Resources&f!"]
	quest.24E87F7032F3E5F3.quest_subtitle: "Summoning Celebi"
	quest.24F29859DA8F81E5.quest_desc: ["Perform a Terastallization with any Pokémon!"]
	quest.24F29859DA8F81E5.quest_subtitle: "Putting into practice"
	quest.24F29859DA8F81E5.title: "Terastallize"
	quest.251DA926BCFE8D3E.quest_desc: ["Scattered around the world, generally in &#3498DBDark Forests&f, we can find &#FF5733Celebi&f's &#2ECC71Home&f!"]
	quest.251DA926BCFE8D3E.quest_subtitle: "Finding Celebi's house"
	quest.251DA926BCFE8D3E.title: "Ilex Shrine"
	quest.259748802C74B3AE.quest_desc: ["We can make a &#FF5733Backpack&f to store our &#2ECC71Items&f, this will be &#3498DBExtremely Useful&f!"]
	quest.259748802C74B3AE.quest_subtitle: "Storing items"
	quest.25A1F47F6D7C6604.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBNecrozma&f is hidden away in a &#E74C3CConcealed Place&f... Prepare yourself for the &#FFD700Final Chapter&f and the &#E74C3CLast Henchman&f! We are coming for you, &#E74C3CEternatus&f!"]
	quest.25A1F47F6D7C6604.quest_subtitle: "Heading to the end!"
	quest.25A1F47F6D7C6604.title: "Necrozma"
	quest.25B04A5B46E30C37.quest_desc: [
		"Once you reach &#3498DBDialga's Pedestal&f and use a \"&#E74C3CRed Chain&f\", a &#3498DBDialga&f will be born!"
		""
		"However, you will lose your &#E74C3CRed Chain&f, so you will need to choose between &#3498DBDialga&f or &#3498DBPalkia&f."
	]
	quest.25B04A5B46E30C37.quest_subtitle: "I choose you Dialga"
	quest.25B04A5B46E30C37.title: "Catch Dialga"
	quest.25DBCD63DDEA9E02.quest_desc: ["To capture &#8E44ADGiratina&f, we must stand firm against the &#8E44ADRevolt&f of &#8E44ADNecrozma&f and &#8E44ADEternatus&f!"]
	quest.25DBCD63DDEA9E02.quest_subtitle: "NOW!"
	quest.25DBCD63DDEA9E02.title: "Catch Giratina"
	quest.263C8D7F3729CC03.quest_desc: ["Okay, let's get back to &#FF5733Reality&f and upgrade our &#3498DBEquipment&f so we can face whatever &#E74C3CEternatus&f throws at us next!"]
	quest.263C8D7F3729CC03.quest_subtitle: "Always upgrading"
	quest.263C8D7F3729CC03.title: "Iron Tools"
	quest.272A7439E29AB810.quest_subtitle: "Have a second chance"
	quest.272A7439E29AB810.title: "Second chance"
	quest.27D249DC8864193D.quest_desc: [
		"Place a &#FFD700PokeMiner&f and have your &#3498DBPokémon&f mine for you!"
		""
		"Place the &#FFD700PokeMiner&f over &#808080Stones&f and your &#3498DBPokémon&f will mine everything!"
	]
	quest.27D249DC8864193D.quest_subtitle: "Putting Pokémon to mine"
	quest.27F281B0922D0029.quest_desc: [
		"A new type of &#FFD700Evolution&f."
		""
		"&#FFD700Terastallization&f is a &#3498DBPokémon&f battle gimmick. It allows you to change a &#3498DBPokémon&f's type."
		""
		"For example: A &#FF5733Torchic&f can terastallize to the &#E67E22Fighting&f type, replacing its &#FF5733Fire&f type for the entire battle. Its weaknesses and resistances will change depending on the &#FFD700Tera Type&f."
		""
		"To start you need to craft a &#3498DBTera Orb&f and equip it."
	]
	quest.27F281B0922D0029.quest_subtitle: "Terastallization"
	quest.2845A297826B971D.quest_desc: ["After going to the &#E74C3CNether&f come back here and let's get some &#9B59B6Legendaries&f!"]
	quest.2845A297826B971D.quest_subtitle: "After some legendaries!"
	quest.2845A297826B971D.title: "Netherite Scrap"
	quest.29FAA004DA12175D.quest_desc: [
		"WHAT IS HAPPENING?!"
		""
		"WHERE ARE YOU, &#8E44ADNECROZMA&f, SHOW YOUR CLAWS AND BE A &#3498DBMAN&f!"
		""
		"RETURN TO THE &#2ECC71NORMAL WORLD&f, LET'S GO AFTER THE &#F1C40FCREATOR OF THE UNIVERSE&f!"
	]
	quest.29FAA004DA12175D.quest_subtitle: "AGAIN?"
	quest.29FAA004DA12175D.title: "It's not possible"
	quest.2A23E3BD0251FDA0.quest_desc: ["&#E74C3CHeatran&f is a &#E74C3CWar&f &#E74C3CTank&f and having him is &#2ECC71Essential&f!"]
	quest.2A23E3BD0251FDA0.quest_subtitle: "Heavyweight!"
	quest.2A23E3BD0251FDA0.title: "Catch Heatran"
	quest.2A282F4B70A9183B.quest_subtitle: "A deer?"
	quest.2A282F4B70A9183B.title: "Catch Ting-Lu"
	quest.2A3EEE10ED57D72D.quest_desc: [
		"With the &#FFD700Titan Key&f in hand, we can unlock the &#FFD700Regigigas Lock&f hidden within &#3498DBSnowpoint Temple&f! Behind the lock, you will find a straightforward corridor leading to a &#FFD700Sanctuary Block&f that needs to be deactivated, a &#FFD700Library Room&f packed with valuable loot, and finally, the &#3498DBRegigigas Summoning Room&f."
		""
		"Once inside the summoning room, step on each of the &#FFD700Circles&f to light them up one by one. Once every circle is illuminated, the ancient &#3498DBRegigigas&f will awaken and be born!"
	]
	quest.2A3EEE10ED57D72D.quest_subtitle: "After the Titan"
	quest.2A72C5790EB9BC92.quest_desc: [
		"Each &#3498DBPokémon&f has its &#FFD700Egg Group&f. Knowing this is important because we can breed &#3498DBPokémon&f of different &#2ECC71Species&f, as long as they are in the same &#FFD700Egg Group&f. For example, we can breed a &#E74C3CCharmander&f with a &#3498DBDratini&f."
		""
		"Use &#9B59B6JEI&f for more information."
	]
	quest.2A72C5790EB9BC92.quest_subtitle: "More details"
	quest.2A72C5790EB9BC92.title: "Egg Group"
	quest.2AF485D01A255459.quest_desc: ["Okay, we're going to need some &#FFD700Armor&f! We're still &#E74C3CWeak&f and we're going to face the &#9B59B6Ender Dragon&f! We suspect that after eliminating the &#9B59B6Ender Dragon&f, &#8E44ADNecrozma&f will be born!"]
	quest.2AF485D01A255459.quest_subtitle: "Trainer, get strong!"
	quest.2AF485D01A255459.title: "Diamond Armor"
	quest.2BC7AE9E16576B92.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBZamazenta&f and &#3498DBZacian&f were among our trusted heroes who helped us in all combats. They are imprisoned within the &#9B59B6Throneroom of Knightly Heroes&f structure, explore the area, find them, and &#2ECC71Capture&f them to add their legendary strength to our team!"]
	quest.2BC7AE9E16576B92.quest_subtitle: "Finding the heroes' temple"
	quest.2CA002CA29F50866.quest_desc: ["Once you have the &#9b59b6Vortex Stone&f, you need to find &#3498DBLugia Temple&f and use the stone to open the &#E74C3CTemple Door&f. Take the stone again, proceed to complete the &#2ECC71Maze&f, and use the &#9b59b6Vortex Stone&f on &#3498DBLugia Pedestal&f for it to be &#FF5733Born&f!"]
	quest.2CA002CA29F50866.quest_subtitle: "A beautiful temple"
	quest.2CA002CA29F50866.title: "Lugia Temple"
	quest.2D1DA990118355DB.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.2D1DA990118355DB.title: "I AM AFRAID OF THE DARK"
	quest.2D85E1B6F1700618.quest_desc: ["Despite everything, this world of ours is still &#3498DBMinecraft&f, even with its problems it's still an &#E67E22Incredible World&f, how about getting some &#2ECC71Wood&f to start?"]
	quest.2D85E1B6F1700618.quest_subtitle: "Is this how you play Minecraft?"
	quest.2D85E1B6F1700618.title: "Starting the game"
	quest.2E88894E67FEA3F1.quest_desc: ["To start our Pokémon &#FF5733Journey&f, we need to press &#3498DB\"M\"&f and choose our &#2ECC71Starter Pokémon&f, it will be our &#E74C3CCompanion&f and our first Pokémon!"]
	quest.2E88894E67FEA3F1.quest_subtitle: "Starting our journey"
	quest.2E88894E67FEA3F1.title: "First Pokemon"
	quest.2EEF494A729018C7.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.2EEF494A729018C7.title: "INFERNAL HEAT"
	quest.2F2579F78778267D.quest_desc: [
		"&#3498DBHydreigon&f has always been a &#E74C3CProblematic&f &#3498DBPokémon&f and didn't like to work..."
		""
		"Who knows, maybe you can correct him? Try finding him in &#3498DBDark&f &#3498DBForest&f biomes."
		""
		"By clicking on the &#2ECC71Reward&f, the &#E74C3CBoss&f will appear!"
	]
	quest.2F2579F78778267D.quest_subtitle: "The evil minion!"
	quest.2F2579F78778267D.title: "Find Dark Forest"
	quest.2FA77B5D5FCA2A4C.quest_subtitle: "Calm as the tide"
	quest.2FA77B5D5FCA2A4C.title: "The Moon"
	quest.3008CACF2AFA43E3.quest_desc: [
		"&#3498DBKeldeo&f is a magnificent and very helpful &#2ECC71Legendary&f, but his thoughts have always &#E74C3CDominated&f him..."
		""
		"To make &#3498DBKeldeo&f appear, it is necessary first to summon &#3498DBCobalion&f, &#3498DBTerrakion&f, and &#3498DBVirizion&f by collecting their &#E67E22Footprints&f. You will obtain a total of &#F1C40F3&f &#FFD700Ingredients&f: &#E67E22Special Meat Chunks&f, &#E67E22Special Spices&f, and &#2ECC71Special Leafy Greens&f. By combining these &#F1C40F3&f &#FFD700Ingredients&f, you will obtain the &#FFD700Curry of Justice&f."
		""
		"After having the &#FFD700Curry of Justice&f, just click and &#3498DBKeldeo&f will &#2ECC71Follow&f!"
	]
	quest.3008CACF2AFA43E3.quest_subtitle: "Keldeo"
	quest.304BF47DDA6CDA9F.quest_subtitle: "Electric Bird"
	quest.304BF47DDA6CDA9F.title: "Catch Zapdos"
	quest.30CAA1E36A906177.quest_desc: ["This is where the &#FF5733Magic&f happens! With our &#3498DBTerminals&f connected, you can browse every single &#2ECC71Item&f in your network from one clean, centralized screen. No more running around between chests!"]
	quest.30CAA1E36A906177.quest_subtitle: "Opening everything"
	quest.30CAA1E36A906177.title: "Terminal"
	quest.314503ADAFF2CF7A.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.314503ADAFF2CF7A.title: "HELP ME MEW-TWO"
	quest.329B6FD9F0DCA00A.quest_desc: ["Let's push our &#FFD700Limits&f further! With our &#FFD700Mega Ring&f, &#E67E22Legendary Allies&f, and full &#3498DBTeam Preparedness&f, we are ready to take down this &#E74C3CDangerous Minion&f and show them what we're &#F1C40FTrully Capable&f of!"]
	quest.329B6FD9F0DCA00A.quest_subtitle: "Evolve 60 times"
	quest.329B6FD9F0DCA00A.title: "Evolve Pokémon"
	quest.33732AE959F12A15.quest_desc: [
		"This is the &#FF5733Base&f of the entire &#3498DBStorage System&f! With it we can connect any type of inventory, for example, we can place just &#2ECC711 Block&f of these and it will connect an entire row of &#3498DBChests&f!"
		""
		"However, connect it to what? You'll find out now!"
	]
	quest.33732AE959F12A15.quest_subtitle: "The base"
	quest.338A1B03827EFA5B.quest_desc: [
		"To catch the ultimate prize, you must first summon &#3498DBArticuno&f, &#F1C40FZapdos&f, and &#FF5733Moltres&f using &#E74C3CUrns&f! Doing so will reward you with three precious relics: the &#3498DBArctic Stone&f, the &#F1C40FZap Stone&f, and the &#FF5733Molten Stone&f. "
		""
		"Combine these three stones on a &#2ECC71Crafting Table&f to forge the ultimate &#9b59b6Vortex Stone&f!"
	]
	quest.338A1B03827EFA5B.quest_subtitle: "After the 3 birds"
	quest.33940E2E165BB3C8.quest_desc: ["&#FFD700Dynamax&f drastically changes our &#3498DBPokémon's&f attributes. It starts with &#E74C3CHP at 50%&f, and by feeding our &#3498DBPokémon&f &#FFD700Dynamax Candies&f, we can increase this value by &#F1C40F5%&f per candy, going all the way up to &#2ECC71100%&f!"]
	quest.33940E2E165BB3C8.quest_subtitle: "Getting stronger"
	quest.33FAAF8E0A5FA804.quest_desc: [
		"Inside this world of ours, we are exploring a new technique called &#F1C40FZ-Moves&f. With it we can equip certain &#F1C40FZ-Items&f on &#3498DBPokémon&f and thereby have a very &#2ECC71Powerful&f &#3498DBMove&f!"
		""
		"To start, craft a &#F1C40FZ-Ring&f and equip it!"
	]
	quest.33FAAF8E0A5FA804.quest_subtitle: "Learning to get stronger"
	quest.340CED2ADBC8FB78.quest_desc: ["Don't give ideas to his barking hahaha."]
	quest.340CED2ADBC8FB78.quest_subtitle: "Zamazenta will defend you to the death"
	quest.340CED2ADBC8FB78.title: "Catch Zamazenta"
	quest.347ED80D0A61F8A5.quest_desc: ["Craft an &#F1C40FUrn&f and complete your &#FF5733Challenge&f of eliminating &#E74C3C50 Pokémon&f of the chosen &#3498DBType&f!"]
	quest.347ED80D0A61F8A5.quest_subtitle: "Zapdos"
	quest.34B0CE8771FFAF78.quest_desc: ["The more the merrier, right? How about hatching 10 new eggs?"]
	quest.34B0CE8771FFAF78.quest_subtitle: "New Eggs"
	quest.34B0CE8771FFAF78.title: "Hatch 10 Eggs"
	quest.351F510F369BF715.quest_desc: ["This &#2ECC71Small&f and &#2ECC71Powerful&f &#F1C40FItem&f is &#2ECC71Extremely&f &#2ECC71Good&f; it shows which &#3498DBPokémon&f can hatch and the percentage chance of hatching. Something truly &#2ECC71Incredible&f!"]
	quest.351F510F369BF715.quest_subtitle: "A unique artifact!"
	quest.3527AAAA026141A5.quest_desc: [
		"&#8E44ADDarkrai&f is a hidden creature that never decided its side in this battle."
		""
		"Let's go after it. For that we need 5 &#8E44ADNightmare Essences&f obtained by sleeping with the &#8E44ADLucid Dreaming&f effect granted by sleeping near a &#3498DBDream Catcher&f."
	]
	quest.3527AAAA026141A5.quest_subtitle: "Chasing nightmares"
	quest.366FEB0A4677B855.quest_desc: ["To summon this &#FF5733Majestic Legendary&f, all you need to do is finish that thrilling &#3498DBParkour&f climb and place the &#2ECC71Rainbow Wing&f right on the pedestal! Get ready, because catching him will test your &#E74C3CPatience&f!"]
	quest.366FEB0A4677B855.quest_subtitle: "The Rainbow Bird"
	quest.366FEB0A4677B855.title: "Catch Ho-Oh"
	quest.3677249AE1FFCF2E.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBReshiram&f is truly a breathtaking &#FFD700Legendary&f, but behind that &#2ECC71Radiant Grace&f lies a &#E74C3CCunning Mind&f—never let its persuasive &#E67E22Words&f sway your &#F1C40FResolve&f!"]
	quest.3677249AE1FFCF2E.quest_subtitle: "Impressive"
	quest.3677249AE1FFCF2E.title: "Reshiram Captured"
	quest.37178694EF28103B.quest_desc: ["Okay, that was &#F1C40FIncredible&f &#3498DBTrainer&f! You're really starting to get &#E74C3CStrong&f! But it's not over yet."]
	quest.37178694EF28103B.quest_subtitle: "Reshiram strikes fear!"
	quest.37178694EF28103B.title: "Next henchman"
	quest.374C36B55CFC31A8.quest_desc: ["Exploring the world and collecting new &#FF5733Apricorns&f will be essential for our &#F1C40FExploration&f!"]
	quest.374C36B55CFC31A8.quest_subtitle: "How about new Poké Balls?"
	quest.374C36B55CFC31A8.title: "Apricorns"
	quest.3848E0E21DA4734E.quest_desc: [
		"After having a &#E67E22Rock&f &#E67E22Golem&f &#E67E22Key&f, you can unlock the &#E67E22Regirock&f &#E67E22Lock&f."
		""
		"Behind the lock will be a &#E74C3CTest&f where each block on the floor is lined with &#F1C40FSand&f blocks and &#E74C3CPressure&f &#E74C3CPlates&f. Right-click the &#F1C40FNote&f &#F1C40FBlock&f next to the entrance and the &#E74C3CRedstone&f &#E74C3CLamps&f on the ceiling will light up a &#2ECC71Safe&f path to walk on."
	]
	quest.3848E0E21DA4734E.quest_subtitle: "Behind the door"
	quest.3848E0E21DA4734E.title: "Find Snowpoint Temple"
	quest.38539F5BD1248C2A.quest_desc: ["Now let's go after two other &#F1C40FLegendaries&f, combine the &#FFD700Uxie Claw&f, &#FFD700Mesprit Plume&f, and &#FFD700Azelf Fang&f to form this precious item!"]
	quest.38539F5BD1248C2A.quest_subtitle: "Next legendaries"
	quest.389D746ADCDFF017.quest_desc: [
		"Okay, &#3498DBTrainer&f, you need to trust me or everything could go wrong, he is already almost taking over the &#E74C3CConsciousness&f of all &#3498DBPokémon&f... "
		""
		"In our ancient books, it said something about a structure called '&#8E44ADTurnback Cave&f', apparently there is a portal there to a &#8E44ADDistorted World&f, a reality different from ours, where we can find the next challenge and where &#8E44ADNecrozma&f possibly is!"
	]
	quest.389D746ADCDFF017.quest_subtitle: "After a new world"
	quest.389D746ADCDFF017.title: "Distortion World"
	quest.38EC340AB31AF23B.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.38EC340AB31AF23B.title: "VICTINI SUFFERS"
	quest.391B4573757B4A6F.quest_subtitle: "Have a second chance"
	quest.391B4573757B4A6F.title: "Second chance"
	quest.39B0E5CF13BB35D9.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.39B0E5CF13BB35D9.title: "DISCOVER THE TRUTH"
	quest.39C5D354ED94C19A.quest_desc: ["Sometimes it's better to be &#2ECC71Safe Than Sorry&f, just in case &#FF5733Greninja&f decided to take &#E74C3CRevenge&f on you? Hahaha"]
	quest.39C5D354ED94C19A.quest_subtitle: "I understand your choice..."
	quest.39C5D354ED94C19A.title: "Greninja Defeated"
	quest.39CEF91DE9F3D1F7.quest_desc: ["If a &#3498DBPokémon&f allocated in the &#9B59B6Pasture&f is holding a &#FFD700Mirror Herb&f, it will pass its &#E74C3CMoves&f to the &#2ECC71Offspring&f."]
	quest.39CEF91DE9F3D1F7.quest_subtitle: "Moves"
	quest.3A88127A65610AF1.quest_desc: [
		"Let's see if you've really learned!"
		""
		"&5Collect 1 egg!"
	]
	quest.3A88127A65610AF1.quest_subtitle: "In practice!"
	quest.3A98EF5C059D82D1.quest_desc: [
		"The first minion that &#E74C3CEternatus&f dominated is a &#3498DBGreninja&f... it's a pity that &#FF5733Happened&f."
		""
		"However, you will free it from this &#E74C3CEvil&f; you can choose between &#2ECC71Sacrificing It&f or &#FF5733Capturing It&f!"
		""
		"By clicking on the &#3498DBReward&f, the &#E74C3CBoss&f will appear!"
	]
	quest.3A98EF5C059D82D1.quest_subtitle: "After the first"
	quest.3AB764444515D04C.quest_desc: ["Ready or not, here we go!"]
	quest.3AB764444515D04C.quest_subtitle: "Prepare yourself Eternatus"
	quest.3AB764444515D04C.title: "Eternatus"
	quest.3B003FCC924E96C8.quest_desc: [
		"&#3498DBRegigigas&f truly rules as the &#FFD700King of all Regis&f!"
		""
		"To awaken this colossal master, you must first have successfully summoned all five of his legendary subjects: &#3498DBRegirock&f, &#3498DBRegisteel&f, &#3498DBRegice&f, &#3498DBRegieleki&f, and &#3498DBRegidrago&f!"
	]
	quest.3B003FCC924E96C8.quest_subtitle: "After Regigigas"
	quest.3B003FCC924E96C8.title: "Tablets"
	quest.3BA3A8DE34666BD5.quest_subtitle: "Tiny"
	quest.3BA3A8DE34666BD5.title: "Catch Chi-Yu"
	quest.3C6968FFE04DE7AD.quest_desc: ["&cThe earth is \"free\", Pokémon continue to be human toys, you failed!"]
	quest.3C6968FFE04DE7AD.quest_subtitle: "The book closed..."
	quest.3C6968FFE04DE7AD.title: "Eternatus Defeated"
	quest.3D05E9DA1BA46148.quest_desc: [
		"We noticed something quite funny in the &#E74C3CNether&f, what appears to be a &#9B59B6Totem&f, we have a goal of collecting 8!"
		""
		"So let's accomplish it! Collect 8 &#E74C3CFirescourge&f &#E74C3CStakes&f scattered across all &#E74C3CNether&f biomes and let's go after a &#F1C40FLegendary&f!"
	]
	quest.3D05E9DA1BA46148.quest_subtitle: "Finding 8"
	quest.3D05E9DA1BA46148.title: "Chi-Yu"
	quest.3D203B3B1388E69A.quest_desc: ["Before traveling to the &#E74C3CNether&f, how about having new &#3498DBPoké&f &#3498DBBalls&f? I think we'll need &#F1C40FThem&f!"]
	quest.3D203B3B1388E69A.quest_subtitle: "The more the merrier!"
	quest.3D203B3B1388E69A.title: "Poké Balls"
	quest.3D55EF8FEF9DDE43.quest_desc: [
		"Our &#3498DBMeltan&f may have started at &#F1C40FLevel 5&f, but we can push it further into &#FFD700Melmetal&f! To do this, reuse the &#FFD700Mystery Box&f and gather another &#F1C40F50 Metal Points&f to earn &#FFD700Meltan Candy&f."
		""
		"Once you feed &#F1C40F64&f &#FFD700Meltan Candies&f to your &#3498DBMeltan&f, it will evolve into the mighty &#3498DBMelmetal&f!"
	]
	quest.3D55EF8FEF9DDE43.quest_subtitle: "Level 5?"
	quest.3D55EF8FEF9DDE43.title: "Catch Meltan"
	quest.3F81ABA831F116B7.quest_desc: [
		"&#8E44ADEternatus&f - &#3498DBBEN&f'S STORIES... HAHAHA BELIEVE WHAT YOU WANT &#3498DBKID&f I WON'T STOP YOU... TURN IN 500 &#3498DBGALAR PARTICLES&f IN MY &#8E44ADCOCOON&f."
		""
		"AFTER THAT, IT WILL BE UP TO YOU!"
		""
		"* CAPTURE ME AND KNOW THE WHOLE TRUTH"
		"* DEFEAT ME AND CLOSE YOUR EYES TO REALITY"
	]
	quest.3F81ABA831F116B7.quest_subtitle: "Everything has a price"
	quest.3F81ABA831F116B7.title: "Galar Particle"
	quest.3FBCC240585C8B63.quest_desc: ["Activate the portal and jump into it!"]
	quest.3FBCC240585C8B63.quest_subtitle: "We've arrived!"
	quest.3FBCC240585C8B63.title: "The End?"
	quest.3FD75A9BD7B55145.quest_desc: [
		"Hello &#607078Trainer&f!"
		"I am Professor Ben and I will accompany you on your &#FF5733Journey&f!"
		"I hope you can manage to &#2ECC71Save&f our world."
		""
		"Welcome to the world of Ancient Cobblemon..."
		""
		"In this &#3498DBAncient World&f of ours, we live without machines, far from that technological world everyone loves and something &#E67E22Strange is happening&f lately, a monster... &#9B59B6Eternatus&f is haunting our &#E74C3CPeaceful Union&f between humans and pokemons..."
		""
		"Complete the chapters of your &#F1C40FMinions' Challenges&f and battle against them at the end! Show your &#E74C3CHonor&f and save our lives."
	]
	quest.3FD75A9BD7B55145.quest_subtitle: "A world of wars"
	quest.3FD75A9BD7B55145.title: "Starting"
	quest.4047878C25B6CA39.quest_desc: ["Perhaps getting a &6little better equipped&f can help!"]
	quest.4047878C25B6CA39.quest_subtitle: "Getting stronger"
	quest.4047878C25B6CA39.title: "Iron Armor"
	quest.4120631A6C2D108E.quest_desc: [
		"&#8E44ADNecrozma&f can only be hiding behind &#FF69B4Hoopa&f's pranks, so let's go!"
		""
		"Fly out of the &#9B59B6End&f island and find &#FF69B4Hoopa&f's pyramid. In this pyramid, you need to complete a &#E67E22Maze&f until you find a &#F1C40FChest&f and find your first &#3498DBTemple Key&f."
		""
		"After placing it in the keyhole, we can go to the next challenge: a huge illusionist &#FF69B4Hoopa&f will be born, we need to eliminate it and obtain a &#3498DBTemple Key&f."
		""
		"For the next area we need to complete a &#3498DBQuiz&f, I really don't know how to complete it..."
	]
	quest.4120631A6C2D108E.quest_subtitle: "Hoopa is a joker"
	quest.4120631A6C2D108E.title: "Find Hoopa Pyramid"
	quest.416B59E4A0406D32.quest_desc: ["A &#3498DBSmall&f &#E74C3CMonster&f is on the loose in the &#E74C3CNether&f, it's not a very &#2ECC71Strong&f &#F1C40FLegendary&f, but if used well it can help a lot!"]
	quest.416B59E4A0406D32.quest_subtitle: "Hot rock!"
	quest.419BF332E69A2F00.quest_desc: [
		"Now that we are &#F1C40FStrong&f, we need to seek out &#3498DBKyurem&f! To find him, travel to a &#3498DBFrozen Peaks&f biome. It is &#E74C3CExtremely Important&f that you do not believe his stories!"
		""
		"Once you are there, simply click on the &#FFD700Reward&f to make the &#E74C3CBoss&f appear!"
	]
	quest.419BF332E69A2F00.quest_subtitle: "Prepare yourself Kyurem!"
	quest.419BF332E69A2F00.title: "Find Frozen Peaks"
	quest.41DC14FBADC2E5A1.quest_desc: ["Kid, we are heading to the last chapter! Be very careful with what might happen!"]
	quest.41DC14FBADC2E5A1.quest_subtitle: "Necrozma the last"
	quest.41DC14FBADC2E5A1.title: "Next henchman"
	quest.41E9F40575FB4DAA.quest_desc: ["HAHAHHAHAHA WE CAPTURED &#8E44ADNECROZMA&f, NOW WE ARE 1 STEP AWAY FROM ENDING ALL OF THIS!"]
	quest.41E9F40575FB4DAA.quest_subtitle: "Incredible"
	quest.41E9F40575FB4DAA.title: "Necrozma Captured"
	quest.421F9ACF2A29C4D0.quest_desc: ["How about a new legendary?"]
	quest.421F9ACF2A29C4D0.quest_subtitle: "Find a village"
	quest.421F9ACF2A29C4D0.title: "Villages"
	quest.424FA465098A2AEB.quest_desc: ["Okay, adventurer, I know you and your Pokémon are &#FF5733Best Friends&f, but we need to form a &#E74C3CTeam&f. Grab your first Pokémon; to make capture easier, you can enter &#3498DBBattle&f with it and deal some damage or inflict a &#2ECC71Sleep Effect&f."]
	quest.424FA465098A2AEB.quest_subtitle: "Our first capture"
	quest.424FA465098A2AEB.title: "Catch Pokémon"
	quest.426C67B595085539.quest_desc: ["To handle all these &#FF5733Items&f, we need a serious &#3498DBStorage System&f! Let's set up a &#2ECC71Mega Storage Network&f so you never have to worry about running out of space during your adventures."]
	quest.426C67B595085539.quest_subtitle: "Smart storage"
	quest.426C67B595085539.title: "Tom Storage"
	quest.42A710D4D038CF8F.quest_desc: ["Victini will be very useful!"]
	quest.42A710D4D038CF8F.quest_subtitle: "You are incredible!"
	quest.42A710D4D038CF8F.title: "Catch Victini"
	quest.437F0D8BB943AA7D.quest_desc: ["To unlock the true power of &#FFD700Dynamax&f, we need to equip our &#FFD700Dynamax Band&f! With it equipped and standing at least &#F1C40F20 Blocks Away&f from a &#9B59B6Power Spot&f, we have almost everything ready for battle!"]
	quest.437F0D8BB943AA7D.quest_subtitle: "Putting on the sweatband"
	quest.43EB3C7EB8BFF692.quest_desc: [
		"To capture &#3498DBRegieleki&f and &#3498DBRegidrago&f, we must face a unique challenge unlike any other legendary!"
		""
		"To start, we need to craft and use the &#FFD700Electric Key&f to unlock their domain!"
	]
	quest.43EB3C7EB8BFF692.quest_subtitle: "Regieleki and Regidrago"
	quest.44856B62A8B26829.quest_desc: ["Now that we have almost everything ready, we can continue, return to the &#2ECC71Normal&f &#2ECC71World&f!"]
	quest.44856B62A8B26829.quest_subtitle: "We need to go back!"
	quest.44856B62A8B26829.title: "Back Overworld"
	quest.44F80D8334273D97.quest_desc: [
		"Trainer, how about you take things &#E74C3CMore Seriously&f? We need really &#3498DBBetter Pokémon&f! Level up some more levels and get &#FF5733Ready&f!"
		""
		"Take these items as well, they will be &#2ECC71Important&f and can be used during &#FF5733Battles&f!"
		""
		"How about &#FF5733Fighting&f and &#2ECC71Bug-Type&f Pokémon?"
	]
	quest.44F80D8334273D97.quest_subtitle: "Time to evolve!"
	quest.44F80D8334273D97.title: "Evolve Pokémon"
	quest.44FF35FB0D747DB4.quest_desc: ["If there's one thing we advise in this world, it's &#FF5733Exploring&f. How about exploring a bit and taking the opportunity to collect some &#2ECC71Apricorns&f? They will be &#E74C3CEssential&f to craft our &#3498DBPoké Balls&f."]
	quest.44FF35FB0D747DB4.quest_subtitle: "Braving the world"
	quest.44FF35FB0D747DB4.title: "Apricorn"
	quest.45E57CEED0E9CFA2.quest_desc: ["These &#2ECC71Incredible&f &#3498DBFlying&f &#F1C40FLegendaries&f are &#2ECC71Majestic&f and &#2ECC71Unique&f, the two complement each other. To start going after them, you need to craft the &#F1C40FTreat&f of one of them!"]
	quest.45E57CEED0E9CFA2.quest_subtitle: "Latios and Latias"
	quest.45E57CEED0E9CFA2.title: "Treat"
	quest.45FB9C3B46B11CD2.quest_desc: ["To summon our &#FF5733Celebi&f, we need to &#2ECC71Right-Click&f with the &#3498DBGS Ball&f at the &#FF5733Ilex Shrine&f!"]
	quest.45FB9C3B46B11CD2.quest_subtitle: "A cute one!"
	quest.45FB9C3B46B11CD2.title: "Celebi"
	quest.4775FE2808EE1AB2.quest_desc: [
		"Done, now let's &#2ECC71Learn&f in &#2ECC71Practice&f. Take this &#F1C40FZ-Move&f and put it on a &#3498DBNormal-Type&f &#3498DBPokémon&f, and now enter into a &#2ECC71Battle&f against a &#3498DBPokémon&f!"
		""
		"During this &#2ECC71Battle&f click on the &#F1C40FZ-Move&f button to activate &#F1C40FZ-Attacks&f, they are only available for one round, in compensation the attack is much more &#2ECC71Powerful&f!"
	]
	quest.4775FE2808EE1AB2.quest_subtitle: "In practice!"
	quest.47CD51D7257C8DEE.quest_desc: ["We can connect our &#3498DBStorage Terminals&f directly using a &#2ECC71Storage Cable&f and a &#FF5733Connector&f! Incredible right? Much easier, here in our world everything is simpler, we prefer it that way!"]
	quest.47CD51D7257C8DEE.quest_subtitle: "And for chests farther away from my system?"
	quest.47F1E43AD23C8041.quest_desc: [
		"To start we need two &#3498DBPokémon&f, male and &#E74C3CFemale&f. There are &#3498DBPokémon&f like &#FFD700Ditto&f, where it has no gender, but &#FFD700Ditto&f has the ability to breed with any other &#2ECC71Species&f!"
		""
		"Just place the two &#3498DBPokémon&f in the &#9B59B6Pasture Block&f and check the option to allow &#F1C40FBreeding&f."
		""
		"The more &#3498DBPokémon&f in the &#9B59B6Pasture Block&f, the more &#E67E22Eggs&f are generated!"
		""
		"&#E74C3CLegendaries&f do not breed."
	]
	quest.47F1E43AD23C8041.quest_subtitle: "How it works"
	quest.47F1E43AD23C8041.title: "How it works?"
	quest.47FBEE9C8D6E644E.quest_desc: [
		"Different types of &#FF5733Apricorns&f form different types of &#3498DBPoké Balls&f, but what does that change? Absolutely &#E74C3CEVERYTHING&f!"
		""
		"Different Poké Balls have different &#2ECC71Effects&f that can help or hinder capture, or some just improve the &#3498DBChance&f. Craft various Poké Balls and always stay &#FF5733Ready&f!"
	]
	quest.47FBEE9C8D6E644E.quest_subtitle: "New types"
	quest.486EB38D73EF657C.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat all the pokemons summoned by the &#E67E22Trial Spawner&f of the Pokemon inside the &#3498DBLake Cave&f to receive the &#F1C40FProof of Conquest&f item"
		""
		"Right-click with the &#F1C40FProof of Conquest&f to summon &#F1C40FUxie&f"
	]
	quest.486EB38D73EF657C.quest_subtitle: "Yellow"
	quest.486EB38D73EF657C.title: "Catch Uxie"
	quest.48C080B52AC77EE5.quest_desc: [
		"Let's see if you learned!"
		""
		"Revive a pokemon"
	]
	quest.48C080B52AC77EE5.quest_subtitle: "Reviving a Pokémon"
	quest.48C080B52AC77EE5.title: "Revive Fossil"
	quest.4922A5AC5BA04C3A.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBZekrom&f has always been &#E74C3CMischievous&f, watch out for him... but he is still a very &#F1C40FStrong&f &#3498DBPokémon&f!"]
	quest.4922A5AC5BA04C3A.quest_subtitle: "Great choice"
	quest.4922A5AC5BA04C3A.title: "Zekrom Captured"
	quest.49ED26C5B8BEA928.quest_desc: ["Usually we use these drawers to store &#FF5733Pokémon Food&f, but how about using them to store some &#2ECC71Little Things&f?"]
	quest.49ED26C5B8BEA928.quest_subtitle: "Perfect for the home"
	quest.4A90180FA0E574D0.quest_desc: ["Since we use our &#3498DBPokémon&f for everything in this world, we also use them to go on &#F1C40FExpeditions&f and they bring us &#2ECC71Resources&f! Incredible, right? It can be very &#9B59B6Useful&f!"]
	quest.4A90180FA0E574D0.quest_subtitle: "Expeditions"
	quest.4AD9FE1CFDF19330.quest_desc: ["Trainer, how about improving your &#3498DBPokémons&f? Our next &#E74C3CChallenge&f is quite strong and &#9B59B6Powerful&f! So be &#F1C40FCareful&f!"]
	quest.4AD9FE1CFDF19330.quest_subtitle: "Getting Better and Better"
	quest.4AD9FE1CFDF19330.title: "Evolve Pokemons"
	quest.4C19209716752539.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.4C19209716752539.title: "STOP, PLEASE"
	quest.4CE29237AB2E9333.quest_desc: [
		"In a period much older than ours, several &#3498DBPokémon&f lived here! We learned a lot from them, but many were &#E74C3CForgotten&f..."
		""
		"To bring them back to &#2ECC71Life&f, grab a &#FFD700Brush&f and excavate &#9B59B6Suspicious Sand&f or &#9B59B6Suspicious Gravel&f. A &#E67E22Pokémon Fossil&f can be obtained this way!"
	]
	quest.4CE29237AB2E9333.quest_subtitle: "Discovering new Pokémon"
	quest.4CFCA704AC4EA989.quest_desc: ["The &#E74C3CNether&f, as dangerous as it is, has several new &#3498DBPokémons&f and things to &#F1C40FExplore&f. Get some &#F1C40FBlaze&f &#F1C40FRods&f; defeating &#3498DBPokémons&f can reward you with &#F1C40FBlaze&f &#F1C40FRods&f."]
	quest.4CFCA704AC4EA989.quest_subtitle: "What is in the Nether?"
	quest.4CFCA704AC4EA989.title: "Blaze Rod"
	quest.4E1762D38E0F4B10.quest_desc: ["Congratulations, &#3498DBTrainer&f! That &#E74C3CTitan&f was &#F1C40FIncredible&f, even if a bit &#E74C3CCrazy&f and speaking in &#FFD700Riddles&f!"]
	quest.4E1762D38E0F4B10.quest_subtitle: "The Colossus"
	quest.4E1762D38E0F4B10.title: "Catch Regigigas"
	quest.4E7954820862BDAD.quest_desc: ["To go after &#FF5733Mew&f, you first need to find a &#2ECC71Jungle Temple&f."]
	quest.4E7954820862BDAD.quest_subtitle: "Mew?"
	quest.4E8ABE9CAC936175.quest_desc: ["To &#2ECC71Mega Evolve&f a &#3498DBPokémon&f during a &#2ECC71Battle&f, you need to craft the &#FFD700Mega Stone&f, equip it to your &#3498DBPokémon&f, and then click on the &#FFD700Mega Form&f button right in the middle of combat!"]
	quest.4E8ABE9CAC936175.quest_subtitle: "Mega Evolve your Pokémon"
	quest.4E8ABE9CAC936175.title: "Mega Evolve"
	quest.4E9A0BF419DE8B08.quest_desc: [
		"This &#2ECC71Incredible&f &#3498DBPokémon&f is an &#BDC3C7Incredibly&f &#BDC3C7Strong&f &#BDC3C7Steel&f &#BDC3C7Monster&f that can help you a lot!"
		""
		"In the summoning room, step on each circle to light it up. Once each circle is lit, a level 40 &#BDC3C7Registeel&f will be &#2ECC71Born&f."
	]
	quest.4E9A0BF419DE8B08.quest_subtitle: "Strong and big"
	quest.4E9A0BF419DE8B08.title: "Catch Registeel"
	quest.4ECF7682C23A4703.quest_subtitle: "Get a fresh start"
	quest.4ECF7682C23A4703.title: "Second Chance"
	quest.4F69059DFCE19519.quest_desc: [
		"&#8E44ADETERNATUS&f - &#3498DBTHANK YOU, TRAINER&f! &#3498DBTHANK YOU&f FOR NOT TRUSTING &#8E44ADBEN&f'S WORDS!"
		""
		"&#8E44ADBEN&f IS A &#E74C3CLUNATIC&f WHO, ALONG WITH &#3498DBALAKAZAM&f, APPLIED &#E74C3CHYPNOSIS&f ON ALL &#3498DBPOKÉMON&f AND &#3498DBHUMANS&f AND USED THE &#3498DBPOKÉMON&f AS &#E74C3CSUBORDINATES&f."
		""
		"&#2ECC71FORTUNATELY&f, I MANAGED TO BREAK THE &#E74C3CSPELL&f WITH MY POWERS, &#2ECC71SAVE&f SOME &#3498DBLEGENDARIES&f IN &#F1C40FSHRINES&f AND, NOW THAT YOU ARE ON OUR SIDE, WE NEED TO &#E74C3CDESTROY&f &#8E44ADBEN&f AND &#3498DBALAKAZAM&f!"
	]
	quest.4F69059DFCE19519.quest_subtitle: "The whole truth"
	quest.4F69059DFCE19519.title: "Eternatus Captured"
	quest.4FDF74D2C4BB44C2.quest_desc: ["A &#3498DBLost&f, completely &#3498DBRandom&f &#3498DBLake&f, &#F1C40FExactly&f... &#3498DBAzelf&f has always been &#2ECC71Playful&f and &#E74C3CMaybe&f that was his &#E74C3CPunishment&f..."]
	quest.4FDF74D2C4BB44C2.quest_subtitle: "Finding Azelf"
	quest.4FDF74D2C4BB44C2.title: "Find Lake Valor"
	quest.50B69FF30C4B2595.quest_subtitle: "Do you like birds?"
	quest.50B69FF30C4B2595.title: "New Legendary"
	quest.511E16816EF46BF8.quest_desc: [
		"After obtaining a &#BDC3C7Steel&f &#BDC3C7Golem&f &#BDC3C7Key&f, you will be able to unlock the &#BDC3C7Registeel&f &#BDC3C7Lock&f."
		""
		"Behind the lock will be a &#E74C3CPiston&f &#E74C3CPuzzle&f, where the player must use buttons arranged on the floor to trigger the pistons below, pushing and pulling the &#E74C3CRedstone&f &#E74C3CBlock&f to the objective (the &#F1C40FGold&f &#F1C40FBlock&f). This will unlock the next puzzle with the same objective. Once all 5 puzzles are completed, a wall will descend, revealing the path that leads to the &#E67E22Regirock&f summoning room. On the lower floor, there is an additional puzzle that leads to a &#2ECC71Vault&f room with treasures."
	]
	quest.511E16816EF46BF8.quest_subtitle: "Puzzle"
	quest.511E16816EF46BF8.title: "Find Snowpoint Temple"
	quest.51A1848787ED031C.quest_desc: ["This &#FF5733Greninja&f was so &#3498DBEasy&f that it's better to &#E74C3CFear the Next One&f... Just kidding, haha! Maybe it's good to save this &#2ECC71Energy&f for the next ones, but this one is &#E74C3CDangerous&f too!"]
	quest.51A1848787ED031C.quest_subtitle: "Ready?"
	quest.51A1848787ED031C.title: "Gengar"
	quest.51F56FED3D6D9D57.quest_subtitle: "Get a fresh start"
	quest.51F56FED3D6D9D57.title: "Second chance"
	quest.5348EA8169BB39C0.quest_desc: [
		"We need to find the &#3498DBSnowpoint Temple&f and locate the &#FFD700Elekidrago Door&f inside the chamber. Place the &#FFD700Electric Key&f into the &#FFD700Lock&f!"
		""
		"Behind the barrier lies a trial where you must rotate the four arrows on each of the colored item frames to match the arrows on the colored walls inside each of the four corner alcoves, accessible through a challenging &#E74C3Cjumping obstacle course&f. Once every arrow matches, the wall between the two middle arrows will open, revealing the path to &#3498DBRegieleki&f and &#3498DBRegidrago&f summoning chamber!"
	]
	quest.5348EA8169BB39C0.quest_subtitle: "Find Temple"
	quest.53B35F5805B0B0CA.quest_desc: ["HAHAHHAHAHA &#8E44ADNECROZMA&f WAS ALREADY &#E74C3CCRAZY&f... IT WAS THE BEST THING TO DO!"]
	quest.53B35F5805B0B0CA.quest_subtitle: "A benefit for everyone!"
	quest.53B35F5805B0B0CA.title: "Necrozma Defeated"
	quest.53D517913A01323F.quest_desc: ["After finding a &#E67E22Fossil&f, we need these &#FFD700Machines&f to clean it! For this, you need to place a &#9B59B6Fossil Analyzer&f, on top of it a &#9B59B6Data Monitor&f and next to it a &#9B59B6Restoration Tank&f."]
	quest.53D517913A01323F.quest_subtitle: "Cleaning"
	quest.53D517913A01323F.title: "Fossil Machine"
	quest.540B825670EFEA23.quest_desc: [
		"The second &#E74C3CHenchman&f of &#E74C3CEternatus&f is hidden in a very &#3498DBDistant&f place. Use your &#F1C40FExploration&f &#F1C40FCompass&f and look for the &#9B59B6Ancient&f &#9B59B6Dais&f &#9B59B6Ruins&f structure."
		""
		"When you click the reward, the &#E74C3CBoss&f will &#2ECC71Appear&f!"
	]
	quest.540B825670EFEA23.quest_subtitle: "Gengar, get ready!"
	quest.5423901890D252ED.quest_desc: ["We don't know, but it seems that it is here in this dimension that the &#8E44ADAlmighty &#8E44ADGiratina&f is located."]
	quest.5423901890D252ED.quest_subtitle: "A different world"
	quest.5423901890D252ED.title: "Distortion World"
	quest.55354DC48788086B.quest_desc: [
		"As soon as you arrive at &#3498DBPalkia's Pedestal&f and use a \"&#E74C3CRed Chain&f\", a &#3498DBPalkia&f will be born!"
		""
		"However, you will lose your &#E74C3CRed Chain&f, so you will have to choose between &#3498DBDialga&f or &#3498DBPalkia&f."
	]
	quest.55354DC48788086B.quest_subtitle: "I choose you, Palkia"
	quest.55354DC48788086B.title: "Catch Palkia"
	quest.557887A0AD117BFD.quest_desc: ["That would be a &#2ECC71Fantastic&f idea! Stopping walking for a bit and riding a &#2ECC71Bicycle&f will make your journeys much faster and more &#2ECC71Fun&f!"]
	quest.557887A0AD117BFD.quest_subtitle: "Stopping walking"
	quest.55B3548E6D3991D2.quest_desc: ["To give it &#2ECC71Life&f, we need the &#E67E22Fossil&f and also put some &#FFD700Organic Material&f in the &#9B59B6Machine&f! &#3498DBSeds&f, for example."]
	quest.55B3548E6D3991D2.quest_subtitle: "Organic Materials"
	quest.55B3548E6D3991D2.title: "Wheat Seeds"
	quest.563EC2C5FF0614C7.quest_desc: [
		"This mysterious &#FFD700Mystery Box&f is said to be the key to summoning &#3498DBMeltan&f!"
		""
		"To unlock its power and fill the box, you need a total of &#F1C40F50 Metal Value&f using &#E67E22Copper&f, &#FFD700Iron&f, &#FFD700Gold&f, and &#E67E22Netherite&f!"
	]
	quest.563EC2C5FF0614C7.quest_subtitle: "Melmetal?"
	quest.56EC6D494C82C0D5.quest_desc: ["&#8E44ADETERNATUS&f - APPARENTLY, THE &#E74C3CHYPNOSIS&f MAKES THE &#3498DBPOKÉMON&f HAVE A LOT OF &#E74C3CHEADACHE&f AND GET &#E74C3CLOST&f INSIDE ITS OWN &#E74C3CCONSCIOUSNESS&f!"]
	quest.56EC6D494C82C0D5.quest_subtitle: "Let's go to the meeting and put an end to this!"
	quest.56EC6D494C82C0D5.title: "Back Overworld"
	quest.576DA503F889CB30.quest_desc: [
		"&#8E44ADEternatus&f - HAHAHAHA! Do you really want to come face me? Then meet me in &#9B59B6The End&f."
		""
		"&#3498DBBen&f - That's right, kid, let's finish off &#8E44ADEternatus&f!"
	]
	quest.576DA503F889CB30.quest_subtitle: "Talking to Eternatus"
	quest.577B46FF3FF19D6C.quest_desc: ["This &#3498DBPokémon&f has always been &#FFD700Incredible&f and very &#F1C40FStrong&f, but because of &#E74C3CEternatus&f, it has started to lose its &#E74C3CMind&f. Do not believe its &#FFD700Stories&f!"]
	quest.577B46FF3FF19D6C.quest_subtitle: "A Trojan horse!"
	quest.577B46FF3FF19D6C.title: "Kyurem Captured"
	quest.57CB598C898A1A6D.quest_desc: ["From a &#FF5733Professional Entrepreneur&f to a &#2ECC71Villager&f, he will have a &#3498DBVery Important Trade&f for us!"]
	quest.57CB598C898A1A6D.quest_subtitle: "A new villager"
	quest.58A1D01D8F86CB65.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBRegisteel&f is a &#2ECC71Fantastic&f &#3498DBPokémon&f in every aspect and very &#2ECC71Obedient&f. To go after him, first we need a &#BDC3C7Steel&f &#BDC3C7Golem&f &#BDC3C7Key&f."]
	quest.58A1D01D8F86CB65.quest_subtitle: "The favorite of the three"
	quest.58A9CA709BC22E61.quest_desc: ["Let's go &#E74C3CFast&f, &#3498DBTrainer&f, we don't have much &#F1C40FTime&f! Craft some &#2ECC71Eye of &#2ECC71Ender&f and let's go to the &#9B59B6End&f."]
	quest.58A9CA709BC22E61.quest_subtitle: "Arriving"
	quest.58AA652B5D4E9229.quest_desc: ["An excellent and slightly crazy Dragon-type Legendary he actually makes sense when he speaks..."]
	quest.58AA652B5D4E9229.quest_subtitle: "Dragon Type"
	quest.58AA652B5D4E9229.title: "Catch Regidrago"
	quest.58E5B61F31D3F415.quest_desc: [
		"We know that being a father can sometimes be quite &#E74C3CBoring&f, imagine taking care of all these &#E67E22Eggs&f?"
		""
		"That's why we have this &#FFD700Machine&f: we can place it next to a &#9B59B6Pasture Block&f, it collects the &#E67E22Eggs&f and hatches them &#2ECC71Automatically&f, besides showing all the useful &#3498DBEgg Information&f!"
	]
	quest.58E5B61F31D3F415.quest_subtitle: "Automating"
	quest.59592225FE587CD5.quest_desc: ["Let's go &#E74C3CFast&f, &#3498DBTrainer&f, we don't have much &#F1C40FTime&f! Craft some &#2ECC71Eye of &#2ECC71Ender&f and let's go to the &#9B59B6End&f."]
	quest.59592225FE587CD5.quest_subtitle: "Behind the portal"
	quest.59592225FE587CD5.title: "Eye of Ender"
	quest.59B5394A18D9490C.quest_desc: [
		"In the middle of the sea we can find this &#3498DBLost&f &#3498DBIsland&f, which is the summoning location of &#3498DBLatios&f and &#3498DBLatias&f! To summon them, simply place the &#F1C40FLatios&f or &#F1C40FLatias&f &#F1C40FTreat&f on the altar and the &#F1C40FLegendary&f will be summoned!"
		""
		"Keep in mind that &#3498DBLatias&f and &#3498DBLatios&f share the same pedestal, and you must choose between one or the other."
	]
	quest.59B5394A18D9490C.quest_subtitle: "A lost island"
	quest.5A20E5D732775410.quest_desc: [
		"For &#FF69B4Hoopa&f to appear, we need to place a &#3498DBTemple Key&f on one pedestal and a &#3498DBPrison Bottle&f on the other."
		""
		"And LET'S FACE &#8E44ADNecrozma&f!"
	]
	quest.5A20E5D732775410.quest_subtitle: "Necrozma Time"
	quest.5A20E5D732775410.title: "Catch Hoopa"
	quest.5A679C6267F76E99.quest_desc: [
		"We lived in &#2ECC71Peace&f, we always lived in peace and respected each other."
		""
		"However, everything &#E74C3CChanged&f..."
		""
		"&#9B59B6Eternatus&f appeared late one afternoon, the entire &#3498DBSky Turned Black&f and some pokémons were &#E67E22Hypnotized&f by him. He kidnapped an &#F1C40FAlakazam&f, used its powers and kept it guarded deep inside himself."
	]
	quest.5A679C6267F76E99.quest_subtitle: "Where it all began!"
	quest.5A679C6267F76E99.title: "Explanation"
	quest.5AFA05667C729CF2.quest_desc: [
		"&dCresselia&f - Please, do not believe him! I know your dreams can confuse you, believe in the pokemons, only a few can speak to you."
		""
		"Go back to some of the captured legendary and mythical pokemons and discover the &#E74C3CTruth&f!"
	]
	quest.5AFA05667C729CF2.quest_subtitle: "Thank you"
	quest.5AFA05667C729CF2.title: "Catch Cresselia"
	quest.5B1105A585C7D927.quest_desc: ["Inside the &#3498DBWater Maze&f we must find this &#FF5733First Key&f; with it we can open a &#E74C3CBarrier&f that prevents us from proceeding."]
	quest.5B1105A585C7D927.quest_subtitle: "One Key?"
	quest.5B72E04F91E69C95.quest_desc: ["Capture it and let's see the &#F1C40FMagic&f happen!"]
	quest.5B72E04F91E69C95.quest_subtitle: "We're so close!"
	quest.5B72E04F91E69C95.title: "Catch Arceus"
	quest.5C399E92396A48C3.quest_desc: [
		"After obtaining an &#3498DBIce&f &#3498DBGolem&f &#3498DBKey&f, you can unlock the &#3498DBRegice&f &#3498DBLock&f."
		""
		"Behind the lock will be a &#E74C3CTest&f consisting of a &#3498DBPowder&f &#3498DBSnow&f maze, where some walls can be passed through and others cannot. There is a &#2ECC71Secret&f &#2ECC71Vault&f with treasures hidden in this maze and a shifting &#3498DBPowder&f &#3498DBSnow&f trap before the end. Overcoming the trap leads to the &#3498DBRegice&f summoning room."
	]
	quest.5C399E92396A48C3.quest_subtitle: "Slippery"
	quest.5C399E92396A48C3.title: "Find Snowpoint Temple"
	quest.5CDE56B2B95D859F.quest_desc: ["Ok, having a &#3498DBGengar&f would definitely help a lot in your &#E74C3CCombat&f! &#2ECC71Congratulations&f and thank you for helping us, &#3498DBTrainer&f!"]
	quest.5CDE56B2B95D859F.quest_subtitle: "Dangerous choice"
	quest.5CDE56B2B95D859F.title: "Gengar Defeated"
	quest.5D304869F49DF37C.quest_desc: [
		"Hello, &#FF5733Trainer&f! Good thing you arrived, we need to &#E74C3CSave the World&f before everything turns to smoke."
		""
		"I will try to pass on to you some of the &#3498DBKnowledge&f we have accumulated over so many years!"
	]
	quest.5D304869F49DF37C.quest_subtitle: "The very beginning!"
	quest.5D304869F49DF37C.title: "Gengar"
	quest.5E4CE81F7DCB8C87.quest_desc: [
		"We noticed something quite funny in the &#E74C3CNether&f: what appears to be a &#9B59B6Totem&f, and we have a goal of collecting 8!"
		""
		"So let's accomplish it: collect 8 &#3498DBIcerend&f &#3498DBStakes&f scattered across all &#E74C3CNether&f biomes and let's go after a &#F1C40FLegendary&f!"
	]
	quest.5E4CE81F7DCB8C87.quest_subtitle: "Finding 8"
	quest.5E4CE81F7DCB8C87.title: "Chien-Pao"
	quest.5E656FC1C78AF872.quest_subtitle: "A slug?"
	quest.5E656FC1C78AF872.title: "Catch Wo-Chien"
	quest.5F3E7DEC91707CF5.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBVirizion&f was a majestic &#3498DBPokémon&f before &#E74C3CEternatus&f... It was careful and loved helping with the &#2ECC71Plantations&f. To save it, find &#F1C40F50&f &#3498DBVirizion Footprints&f scattered all over the &#9B59B6World&f, you can find them anywhere!"]
	quest.5F3E7DEC91707CF5.quest_subtitle: "More footprints?"
	quest.5F43C1EE8A20BC19.quest_desc: ["The truth will set you free"]
	quest.5F43C1EE8A20BC19.quest_subtitle: "No, why did you do that?"
	quest.5F43C1EE8A20BC19.title: "Cresselia Defeat"
	quest.61254B71280A7595.quest_subtitle: "OUR HEADS HURT"
	quest.61254B71280A7595.title: "ME, ME, ME... I AM WEAK?"
	quest.615F579A2350EF52.quest_desc: ["&#2ECC71Iron&f will be &#E74C3CWidely Used&f, we have several new things and many of them require iron!"]
	quest.615F579A2350EF52.quest_subtitle: "Our First Irons"
	quest.615F579A2350EF52.title: "Iron"
	quest.624FAA162B1892C3.quest_subtitle: "A white Nether dog?"
	quest.624FAA162B1892C3.title: "Catch Chien-Pao"
	quest.62D5A2AC4C84ED38.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBKyurem&f is the next &#E74C3CBoss&f! It was completely &#E74C3CDelusional&f when it was &#E67E22Captured&f by &5Eternatus&f."]
	quest.62D5A2AC4C84ED38.quest_subtitle: "Kyurem"
	quest.62D5A2AC4C84ED38.title: "Next henchman"
	quest.632EC419F9A53035.quest_desc: ["In the cold and intense ice, Suicune can be excellent."]
	quest.632EC419F9A53035.quest_subtitle: "3 Caos Lendários"
	quest.632EC419F9A53035.title: "Capturar Suicune"
	quest.637979CBE5E3BF20.quest_desc: ["Ok, now that we are on the last floor, we need to complete two &#E67E22Mazes&f and, in these two mazes, we need to get a &#3498DBPrison Bottle&f and a &#3498DBTemple Key&f."]
	quest.637979CBE5E3BF20.quest_subtitle: "Another labyrinth..."
	quest.63B4E862C6F2ACD9.quest_desc: [
		"&#E74C3CEverything is collapsing&f around us, so we must move &#FFD700Fast&f!"
		""
		"Grab your &#FFD700New Tools&f and let's run straight into the &#FFD700Final Clash&f!"
	]
	quest.63B4E862C6F2ACD9.quest_subtitle: "New Tools"
	quest.63B4E862C6F2ACD9.title: "Diamond Tools"
	quest.64DC7301CC0BC1AB.quest_desc: [
		"What is &#FFD700Mega Evolution&f?"
		""
		"&#FFD700Mega Evolution&f is a &#2ECC71Battle Mechanic&f where a &#3498DBPokémon&f assumes a different &#E74C3CForm&f for the rest of the battle, greatly increasing its &#F1C40FPower&f!"
	]
	quest.64DC7301CC0BC1AB.quest_subtitle: "Mega Strong"
	quest.64DC7301CC0BC1AB.title: "Mega Evolutions"
	quest.6570AFC2ED667DC0.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.6570AFC2ED667DC0.title: "WHERE ARE THEY?"
	quest.65EF15F75EC5E935.quest_desc: ["&#FF5733Mew&f is one of the most &#3498DBAcclaimed Legendaries&f of our world, kid! Congratulations, who knows, maybe it will even turn into a &#E74C3CMewtwo&f."]
	quest.65EF15F75EC5E935.quest_subtitle: "Mewwwww!"
	quest.65EF15F75EC5E935.title: "Capturar Mew"
	quest.65F5F8B046E46472.quest_desc: ["A completely new &#8E44ADWorld&f? What a strange place... Maybe following the &#3498DBStairs&f is the best option..."]
	quest.65F5F8B046E46472.quest_subtitle: "What place is this?"
	quest.665C9C2BC1CEA837.quest_desc: [
		"We noticed something quite funny in the &#E74C3CNether&f: what appears to be a &#9B59B6Totem&f, and we have a goal of collecting 8!"
		""
		"So let's accomplish it: collect 8 &#E74C3CGrasswither&f &#E74C3CStakes&f scattered across all &#E74C3CNether&f biomes and let's go after a &#F1C40FLegendary&f!"
	]
	quest.665C9C2BC1CEA837.quest_subtitle: "Finding 8"
	quest.665C9C2BC1CEA837.title: "Wo-Chien"
	quest.66BB4BA664390731.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBZekrom&f is clearly a very &#E74C3CProblematic&f &#3498DBPokémon&f, even though it is very &#F1C40FStrong&f!"]
	quest.66BB4BA664390731.quest_subtitle: "The best was done!"
	quest.66BB4BA664390731.title: "Zekrom Defeated"
	quest.67CB60AD8AC270C2.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.67CB60AD8AC270C2.title: "IT'S ALL DARK"
	quest.686D6B74DA05D49E.quest_desc: ["He is a very &#2ECC71Strong&f &#3498DBPokémon&f, but be careful, &#2ECC71Trainer&f: he has always been very &#E74C3CDifficult&f to handle!"]
	quest.686D6B74DA05D49E.quest_subtitle: "WOW, AMAZING"
	quest.686D6B74DA05D49E.title: "Hydreigon Captured"
	quest.68928EECCBA83EC8.quest_desc: [
		"Certainly this challenge is out of this &#3498DBWorld&f... &#3498DBZekrom&f is definitely the greatest &#E74C3CChallenge&f so far! Good luck, kid, and don't fall for his stories."
		""
		"By clicking on the reward, the &#E74C3CBoss&f will appear!"
	]
	quest.68928EECCBA83EC8.quest_subtitle: "Going after the henchman"
	quest.68E590F080E9A111.quest_desc: ["Train a bit more, find new &#3498DBPokémons&f and &#E74C3CDefeat&f them!"]
	quest.68E590F080E9A111.quest_subtitle: "Defeating new Pokémon"
	quest.6A6455AA639AAC75.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.6A6455AA639AAC75.title: "I CAN'T UNDERSTAND ANYTHING AT ALL"
	quest.6AD5782152E98BB5.quest_desc: ["How about improving our &#FF5733Furnaces&f and heating things up &#E74C3CMuch Faster&f?"]
	quest.6AD5782152E98BB5.quest_subtitle: "New Furnaces"
	quest.6B6DAE9912ABF263.quest_desc: ["Here in our world we have several new &#3498DBTools&f that can help, but right now it's good to start with the &#2ECC71Basics&f."]
	quest.6B6DAE9912ABF263.quest_subtitle: "Early tools"
	quest.6B6DAE9912ABF263.title: "Tools Stone"
	quest.6C51A95D263CD030.quest_desc: ["Para capturar o &#2ECC71Celebi&f, precisamos ir ao &#3498DBNether&f e obter um pedaço de &#FF5733Netherite&f!"]
	quest.6C51A95D263CD030.quest_subtitle: "Going to the Nether"
	quest.6CD89E23F693E8DF.quest_subtitle: "Get a fresh start"
	quest.6CD89E23F693E8DF.title: "Second chance"
	quest.6D73F1BBCA3E8B7C.quest_subtitle: "Get a fresh start"
	quest.6D73F1BBCA3E8B7C.title: "Second Chance"
	quest.6DDDD73DBC25BAA4.quest_desc: ["To go after that star, we need to head to the &#9B59B6Wishing Weald&f structure, usually found in &#2ECC71Dark Forests&f. Find and break a &#FFD700Wishing Star Crystal&f!"]
	quest.6DDDD73DBC25BAA4.quest_subtitle: "A strange star..."
	quest.6E52CBF494B942C2.quest_desc: [
		"&#8E44ADETERNATUS&f - &#8E44ADBEN&f IS IN HIS &#3498DBLABORATORY&f!"
		""
		"FIND &#8E44ADBEN&f'S &#3498DBLABORATORY&f, &#E74C3CDESTROY&f &#3498DBALAKAZAM&f AND THIS &#E74C3CNIGHTMARE&f WILL COME TO AN &#2ECC71END&f!"
	]
	quest.6E52CBF494B942C2.quest_subtitle: "Behind Ben"
	quest.6E52CBF494B942C2.title: "Find Ben Laboratory"
	quest.6F1490E12DD5AACD.quest_desc: ["We need to evolve not only in &#3498DBPokémons&f, but also in &#F1C40FMinecraft&f. Get some &#3498DBDianonds&f!"]
	quest.6F1490E12DD5AACD.quest_subtitle: "Vanilla Adventure"
	quest.6F1490E12DD5AACD.title: "Diamante"
	quest.6F2FEEBD0C074CD8.quest_desc: ["When arriving at the structure to summon &#3498DBZacian&f, we need to find a descent and navigate through a &#E74C3CLabyrinth&f until we discover &#3498DBZacian's Sword&f lying on the ground. Pick up the sword, head back up the stairs, and place it alongside a &#FFD700Totem&f on the &#3498DBBlue Pedestals&f!"]
	quest.6F2FEEBD0C074CD8.quest_subtitle: "Zacian"
	quest.6FC8421C0DCF314A.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.6FC8421C0DCF314A.title: "I AM FLYING THROUGH INFINITY"
	quest.705DA4E375BCEBC0.quest_desc: ["To find our new &#FF5733Legendary Pokémon&f, we need to find a traditional &#2ECC71Village&f. Use an &#3498DBExploration Compass&f! However, attention: not every village has the structure we need, which is the &#E74C3CBurned Tower&f!"]
	quest.705DA4E375BCEBC0.quest_subtitle: "New Village"
	quest.7079D1E2C0360C71.quest_desc: [
		"How about a very strong &#E67E22Rock&f type?"
		""
		"&#E67E22Regirock&f is an &#2ECC71Incredible&f &#3498DBPokémon&f and we are going after him! The first step is to craft the &#E67E22Rock&f &#E67E22Golem&f &#E67E22Key&f."
	]
	quest.7079D1E2C0360C71.quest_subtitle: "\"Getting into the rhythm\""
	quest.70C62081687ACF81.quest_desc: ["This item is &#FF5733Essential&f for our next &#3498DBLegendary Captures&f! And it is only possible to obtain it by trading with the &#2ECC71Entrepreneur Villager&f."]
	quest.70C62081687ACF81.quest_subtitle: "A new item!"
	quest.717D4DC265AED733.quest_desc: ["Craft an &#F1C40FUrn&f and complete your &#FF5733Challenge&f of eliminating &#E74C3C50 pokémons&f of the chosen &#3498DBtype&f!"]
	quest.717D4DC265AED733.quest_subtitle: "Moltres"
	quest.71F6233C59A1220E.quest_desc: ["On the other side of the &#3498DBMaze&f we can find &#3498DBLugia Key&f and, with it, finally enter the &#E74C3CFinal Room&f and encounter &#FF5733Lugia&f!"]
	quest.71F6233C59A1220E.quest_subtitle: "The final key!"
	quest.72CA399C8693A450.quest_desc: ["To continue, you need to head to a &#2ECC71Lush Caves&f biome, where we can find &#FFD700Max Mushrooms&f, which can be cultivated on &#2ECC71Moss Blocks&f!"]
	quest.72CA399C8693A450.quest_subtitle: "Taking another part"
	quest.72E1E3A04008C334.quest_desc: ["Always &#2ECC71Obedient&f and willing to do anything! Besides being an &#2ECC71Extremely&f &#F1C40FPowerful&f &#3498DBPokémon&f!"]
	quest.72E1E3A04008C334.quest_subtitle: "One of the smartest"
	quest.72E1E3A04008C334.title: "Catch Latios"
	quest.730478588F531278.quest_desc: [
		"We noticed something quite funny in the &#E74C3CNether&f: what appears to be a &#9B59B6Totem&f, and we have a goal of collecting 8!"
		""
		"So let's accomplish it: collect 8 &#E74C3CGroundblight&f &#E74C3CStakes&f scattered across all &#E74C3CNether&f biomes and let's go after a &#F1C40FLegendary&f!"
	]
	quest.730478588F531278.quest_subtitle: "Finding 8"
	quest.730478588F531278.title: "Ting-Lu"
	quest.734A35ABBAA506D6.quest_subtitle: "Have a second chance"
	quest.734A35ABBAA506D6.title: "Second chance"
	quest.735E46C0AC4FF838.quest_desc: ["After having the &#3498DBWhistle&f, just blow it and a &#8E44ADDarkrai&f will be born from the &#8E44ADNightmares&f!"]
	quest.735E46C0AC4FF838.quest_subtitle: "Blowing the whistle!"
	quest.75E53375E3E86A93.quest_desc: ["We need to travel to the &#E74C3CNether&f. How about getting some &#9B59B6Obsidian&f?"]
	quest.75E53375E3E86A93.quest_subtitle: "Creating Nether Portal"
	quest.75E53375E3E86A93.title: "Nether Portal"
	quest.768E57C3F0C5D7E8.quest_desc: [
		"To go after &#3498DBArticuno&f, we need to create an &#303F3FArticuno Treat&f! This will serve as a &#E74C3CPerect Key&f for what we want to achieve."
		""
		"To summon the &#E74C3CLegendary&f, just use the &#FF5733Articuno Treat&f on one of the &#3498DBPedestals&f inside the &#2ECC71Village&f."
	]
	quest.768E57C3F0C5D7E8.quest_subtitle: "Treat Chilled"
	quest.77328A3891068857.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.77328A3891068857.title: "IT'S ALL A LIE!"
	quest.77B3E2670AA25EDE.quest_desc: [
		"The &#FF5733Bell Tower&f is where you can finally face &#E74C3CHo-Oh&f! To reach the summit, you'll need to master a thrilling &#3498DBParkour&f challenge right up the tower, looting plenty of &#2ECC71Chest Rewards&f along the way."
		""
		"Keep your eyes open, because the Bell Tower has a chance to spawn alongside the Burned Tower right inside the &#3498DBTraditional Village&f!"
	]
	quest.77B3E2670AA25EDE.quest_subtitle: "Back again!"
	quest.77D41277EDAB8917.quest_desc: ["Use this &#FF5733Compass&f to find all the &#2ECC71Biomes&f!"]
	quest.77D41277EDAB8917.quest_subtitle: "Find biomes"
	quest.77F2ABE0564956E2.quest_desc: ["Now, with the &#FFD700Key Stone&f, we can make our &#FFD700Mega Ring&f. With it equipped, we can &#2ECC71Mega Evolve&f our &#3498DBPokémon&f!"]
	quest.77F2ABE0564956E2.quest_subtitle: "We have it all!"
	quest.77F2FC22DC584E13.quest_subtitle: "MY HEAD HURTS"
	quest.77F2FC22DC584E13.title: "I AM NOT HERE"
	quest.78B43F002C873900.quest_desc: ["&#2ECC71Okay&f, &#2ECC71Trainer&f, this is the &#E74C3CReal&f &#E74C3CDanger&f. I believe all the &#E74C3CBosses&f are now at a very &#E74C3CHigh&f &#E74C3CDifficulty&f level, so from now on you will only learn the &#2ECC71Essential&f!"]
	quest.78B43F002C873900.quest_subtitle: "We've arrived..."
	quest.78B43F002C873900.title: "Zekrom"
	quest.78BC4054D4877428.quest_subtitle: "Burning like the flame"
	quest.78BC4054D4877428.title: "The Sun"
	quest.7B4AAF37D40F61C2.quest_desc: ["Terrakion isn't much of a talker... (thank goodness)."]
	quest.7B4AAF37D40F61C2.quest_subtitle: "Terrakion gained weight!"
	quest.7B4AAF37D40F61C2.title: "Catch Terrakion"
	quest.7B75520119C2D81F.quest_desc: ["Let's &#2ECC71Test&f if you learned! Use &#F1C40F50&f &#3498DBMoves&f in &#2ECC71Battles&f!"]
	quest.7B75520119C2D81F.quest_subtitle: "Use 50 moves in battles."
	quest.7B75520119C2D81F.title: "Moves"
	quest.7BF8BC885F041661.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat all &#E74C3CPokémon&f summoned by the &#3498DBPokémon Trial Spawner&f inside the &#3498DBCave&f to be rewarded with the item \"&#F1C40FProof of Conquest&f\"."
		""
		"Right-click with the \"&#F1C40FProof of Conquest&f\" to summon &#3498DBAzelf&f."
	]
	quest.7BF8BC885F041661.quest_subtitle: "Blue"
	quest.7BF8BC885F041661.title: "Catch Azelf"
	quest.7C3601AB4EDF4193.quest_desc: [
		"&#9B59B6Cosmog&f is beautiful and incredible, but its true power is hidden in its evolutions!"
		""
		"After catching it, &#9B59B6Cosmog&f will evolve into &#9B59B6Cosmoem&f at level 43, and &#9B59B6Cosmoem&f will evolve at level 53, where you will have to choose between evolving it into &#3498DBLunala&f or &#F1C40FSolgaleo&f."
	]
	quest.7C3601AB4EDF4193.quest_subtitle: "Straight from the cosmos"
	quest.7C3601AB4EDF4193.title: "Catch Cosmog"
	quest.7D1B6CBF48040390.quest_desc: [
		"Okay, I hope you haven't captured &#3498DBCresselia&f..."
		""
		"Let's go to a new &#3498DBLevel&f, some of our &#3498DBPokémon&f are kind of &#E74C3CAngry&f! Maybe ending this soon is the &#2ECC71Solution&f."
	]
	quest.7D1B6CBF48040390.quest_subtitle: "One more step"
	quest.7D1B6CBF48040390.title: "Reshiram"
	quest.7D8F5E9BA871BFB9.quest_desc: [
		"Now with the &#FF5733Map&f in hand, we can go after the &#E74C3CFinal Island&f!"
		""
		"There we can summon &#3498DBMew&f with this &#2ECC71Map&f."
	]
	quest.7D8F5E9BA871BFB9.quest_subtitle: "That's quite a map!"
	quest.7DE7E711D8B22A0F.quest_desc: ["&#2ECC71Congratulations&f on &#2ECC71Defeating&f this &#E74C3CBeast&f! That &#E74C3CRebel&f was truly a &#E74C3CProblem&f."]
	quest.7DE7E711D8B22A0F.quest_subtitle: "AMAZING!"
	quest.7DE7E711D8B22A0F.title: "Hydreigon Defeated"
	quest.7DEB7722C9DA1AA3.quest_subtitle: "Return to the Nether!"
	quest.7E4D26CD0E9DB22C.quest_desc: ["Craft an &#F1C40FUrn&f and complete your &#FF5733Challenge&f of eliminating &#E74C3C50 pokémons&f of the chosen &#3498DBtype&f!"]
	quest.7E4D26CD0E9DB22C.quest_subtitle: "Articuno"
	quest.7E63E65E1EF0EFB0.quest_desc: ["We need new &#3498DBPokémons&f to expand our &#F1C40FParty&f and have more options against &#E74C3CEternatus&f and his &#9B59B6Henchmen&f!"]
	quest.7E63E65E1EF0EFB0.quest_subtitle: "New pokemons"
	quest.7E63E65E1EF0EFB0.title: "Catch 5 Pokemons"
	quest.7F1C1934142911A0.quest_desc: ["Thank you, boy! You are changing our lives and bringing peace to our world!"]
	quest.7F1C1934142911A0.quest_subtitle: "We want peace!"
	quest.7F1C1934142911A0.title: "Hydreigon"
	quest.7F991B850EC0FA75.quest_desc: ["Virizion doesn't like to talk much, hahaha."]
	quest.7F991B850EC0FA75.quest_subtitle: "Our crops are saved!"
	quest.7F991B850EC0FA75.title: "Catch Virizion"
	quest.7FACB3D997D344F6.quest_desc: [
		"Eliminate the &#9B59B6Ender Dragon&f to unlock our access to &#8E44ADNecrozma&f!"
		""
		"Remember, &#3498DBTrainer&f: do not trust &#8E44ADNecrozma&f, he is &#E74C3CCrazy&f."
		""
		"When clicking on the reward, the &#E74C3CBoss&f will appear!"
	]
	quest.7FACB3D997D344F6.quest_subtitle: "It's the end"
	quest.7FACB3D997D344F6.title: "Kill Ender Dragon"
	quest.7FD6E873F387B2BC.quest_desc: [
		"Within our &#FF5733Ancient World&f, we have several new things, even though it is an ancient world..."
		""
		"Try out some of our &#3498DBFeatures&f:"
		""
		"* &#2ECC71Pokenav&f"
		"* &#2ECC71Pokedex&f"
		"* &#2ECC71Breeding&f"
		"* &#E67E22Mega Evolutions&f"
		"* &#E67E22Dynamax and Gigantamax&f"
		"* &#9B59B6Terastallization&f"
		"* &#F1C40FAlpha&f"
		"* &#3498DBCobbleWorking&f"
		"* &#9B59B6Legendary Spawns&f"
		"* &#9B59B6Legendary Structures&f"
		"* &#E74C3CGyms&f"
		"* &#2ECC71PokeCapsules&f"
		"* &#3498DBCo_Moves&f"
		"* &#2ECC71PokeBike&f"
		"* &#3498DBJEI Information&f"
		""
		"You will learn during your &#FF5733Journey&f! Everything will be &#2ECC71Taught&f."
	]
	quest.7FD6E873F387B2BC.quest_subtitle: "Useful things!"
	quest.7FD6E873F387B2BC.title: "++"
	quest.7FEC8C8D87728EE5.quest_desc: ["&#3498DBLugia&f is truly breathtaking and majestic! To awaken it, place the &#9b59b6Vortex Stone&f onto the &#E74C3CPedestal&f and prepare for the ultimate encounter!"]
	quest.7FEC8C8D87728EE5.quest_subtitle: "How about a strong and beautiful legendary one?"
	quest.7FEC8C8D87728EE5.title: "Catch Lugia"
